ettes require specially designed tips and are not compatible with standard universal pipette tips. Users of less common pipette brands are encouraged to verify compatibility prior to purchase."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/feec2df1-454d-47fe-816a-8fe19dff5984.jpg", "/media/product_images/d95e92d2-bc96-4a94-83e4-33505d5af098.webp", "/media/product_images/6181e58b-2538-4c05-97d5-068d1b6920f0.webp", "/media/product_images/1b5433e4-d9ca-4fda-8c8c-7cd485de63d2.webp", "/media/product_images/06798b99-2925-4234-ab1b-f899b5415e69.jpg"], "manuals": [], "options": ["10 Racks/Box; 5 Boxes/Case"], "createdAt": 1780976114258, "listPrice": "$286", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": [], "keyFeatures": ["\u2022 Low-Retention Surface for Enhanced Sample Recovery and Pipetting Accuracy", "\u2022 Integrated Aerosol Barrier Filter Helps Prevent Cross-Contamination and Liquid Backflow", "\u2022 Universal Compatibility with Most Major Single- and Multi-Channel Pipettes", "\u2022 Manufactured in a Class 100,000 Cleanroom Environment", "\u2022 Certified DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Non-Pyrogenic", "\u2022 Sterile and Ready-to-Use for Sensitive Laboratory Applications", "\u2022 CE Marked and ISO 13485:2016 Certified", "\u2022 Compliant with IVDD 98/79/EC Requirements", "\u2022 Consistent Quality and Reliable Performance for Routine and Precision Liquid Handling", "\u2022 Ideal for PCR, qPCR, Molecular Biology, Cell Culture, and Diagnostic Workflows"], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {}, "catalogNumber": "BA860040", "performanceData": "\u2022 Accurate Liquid Transfer and Precision Pipetting\n\n\u2022 Reagent, Buffer, and Sample Preparation\n\n\u2022 PCR, qPCR, and Nucleic Acid Workflows\n\n\u2022 Sample Dispensing into Microplates, PCR Plates, and Reaction Tubes\n\n\u2022 Cell Culture and Microbiology Applications\n\n\u2022 Electrophoresis Gel Loading\n\n\u2022 ELISA and Diagnostic Assays\n\n\u2022 Supernatan