ays.\n\n\u2022 Provides a reliable platform for drug discovery, toxicity testing, and other cell biology research applications requiring reproducible cell growth.", "storageStability": "", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (46, E'custom-1780712799171', E'Medium Nitrile Examination Gloves, Powder-Free', E'Zircon Touch® Exam Gloves are engineered to deliver exceptional protection, comfort, and tactile sensitivity for a wide range of professional applications. Designed for laboratory research, healthcare environments, food handling, and general-purpose use, these high-quality gloves provide a reliable barrier against contaminants while maintaining the dexterity required for precision tasks.

Manufactured to rigorous quality standards, Zircon Touch® Exam Gloves offer a comfortable fit, excellent flexibility, and dependable performance throughout extended use. Their durable construction helps reduce the risk of tears and punctures, while the textured surface enhances grip and control when handling instruments, samples, or equipment.

Combining protection, comfort, and precision, Zircon Touch® Exam Gloves are an ideal choice for professionals who require reliable hand protection without compromising sensitivity or performance.', E'/media/product_images/a38f62d2-774d-41fd-885e-ef93a6d79cec.webp', E'/reagents/medium-nitrile-examination-gloves-powder-free-medium', E'category-1780539818236', E'Personal Protective Equipment (PPE)', E'product', NULL, 1780712799171, '2026-06-05T21:26:39.171000+00:00', E'GN007-2-C', E'In Stock', E'65', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Exceptional Durability – Designed to withstand demanding laboratory, healthcare, and industrial applications while maintaining reliable protection.', E'• Micro-Textured Surface – Enhances grip and control when handling instruments, samples, and equipment, even in wet conditions.', E'• Strong and Flexible Construction – Combines excellent tensile strength with superior flexibility for enhanced comfort, dexterity, and tactile sensitivity.', E'• Precision Touch Sensitivity – Allows accurate handling of delicate tasks without compromising hand protection.', E'• Color-Coded Size Identification – Packaging is color coded by glove size for quick recognition, simplified inventory management, and improved workflow efficiency.', E'• Comfortable Fit for Extended Wear – Ergonomically designed to reduce hand fatigue during prolonged use.']::text[], ARRAY[E'1000 Pcs/Case']::text[], E'{"1000 Pcs/Case": "$65"}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Laboratory Research and Testing – Provides reliable hand protection and excellent tactile sensitivity for routine laboratory procedures and sample handling.

• Healthcare and Clinical Environments – Suitable for examinations, patient care, and other applications requiring hygiene, comfort, and protection.

• Food Processing and Food Handling – Helps maintain cleanliness and product safety while allowing precise handling of food products.

• Pharmaceutical and Biotechnology Workflows – Ideal for manufacturing, quality control, and research applications where contamination control is essential.

• Precision Handling Tasks – Excellent for applications requiring enhanced dexterity, tactile sensitivity, and accurate manipulation of small instruments or components.

• General Industrial and Workplace Use – Offers a cost-effective solution for a wide range of protective applications requiring both durability and comfort.
