    (47, E'custom-1780979893063', E'24-Well Tissue Culture-Treated Cell Culture Plate, Sterile', E'"BioArk Multiwell Cell Culture Plates are manufactured from premium virgin polystyrene (PS) and feature a tissue culture (TC)-treated surface to promote consistent cell attachment, growth, and proliferation. Designed with flat-bottom wells and supplied with a matching lid, these plates provide an ideal environment for routine cell culture, drug screening, cell-based assays, and other life science research applications.

The precision-engineered plate design helps minimize the impact of external environmental factors while maintaining optimal culture conditions. Thin-walled well bottoms improve thermal consistency across the plate, reducing edge effects and supporting more uniform experimental results. The optically clear flat-bottom wells provide excellent visibility for microscopic observation, imaging, and sample analysis.

Each plate is gamma irradiated and certified non-pyrogenic, DNase-free, RNase-free, and human DNA-free to ensure the highest level of purity for sensitive cell culture and biological research workflows. Manufactured under strict quality standards, BioArk Multiwell Culture Plates offer reliable performance, excellent optical clarity, and consistent results for academic, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical research laboratories."
', E'/media/product_images/e6a2ceb0-afbf-4d6e-87a6-f5e89445dbcd.png', E'/reagents/24-well-tissue-culture-treated-cell-culture-plate-sterile', E'category-1780539818236', E'Cell Culture Plate', E'product', NULL, 1780979893063, '2026-06-08T23:38:13.063000+00:00', E'BA076096', E'In Stock', E'$170', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• TC-Treated Surface', E'• Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction', E'• Flat-Bottom Well Design', E'• Thin-Walled Wells for Enhanced Thermal Consistency', E'• Protective Lid Included', E'• Excellent Optical Clarity', E'• Gamma Irradiated Sterility', E'• Non-Pyrogenic, DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Human DNA-Free', E'• Individually Packaged for Sterility and Convenience', E'• Suitable for Cell Culture and Cell-Based Assays']::text[], ARRAY[E'100Pcs/Package']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/e6a2ceb0-afbf-4d6e-87a6-f5e89445dbcd.png', E'/media/product_images/3ceb8eda-498c-4054-81b1-f77e7ba5c2e3.png', E'/media/product_images/3e73e832-8397-4150-a9b1-b147068c975e.jpg', E'/media/product_images/ce833981-c10e-49d1-ad84-5b432354ab97.jpg', E'/media/product_images/b540b3e8-1f42-44ae-8d51-a29af4814730.jpg']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780979893063", "link": "/reagents/24-well-tissue-culture-treated-cell-culture-plate-sterile", "name": "24-Well Tissue Culture-Treated Cell Culture Plate, Sterile", "category": "category-1780539818236", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1780979893063, "groupName": "Cell Culture Plate", "description": "\"BioArk Multiwell Cell Culture Plates are manufactured from premium virgin polystyrene (PS) and feature a tissue culture (TC)-treated surface to promote consistent cell attachment, growth, and proliferation. Designed with flat-bottom wells and supplied with a matching lid, these plates provide an ideal environment for routine cell culture, drug screening, cell-based assays, and other life science research applications.\n\nThe precision-engineered plate design helps minimize the impact of external environmental factors while maintaining optimal culture conditions. Thin-walled well bottoms improve thermal consistency across the plate, reducing edge effects and supporting more uniform experimental results. The optically clear flat-bottom wells provide excellent visibility for microscopic observation, imaging, and sample analysis.\n\nEach plate is gamma irradiated and certified non-pyrogenic, DNase-free, RNase-free, and human DNA-free to ensure the highest level of purity for sensitive cell culture and biological research workflows. Manufactured under strict quality standards, BioArk Multiwell Culture Plates offer reliable performance, excellent optical clarity, and consistent results for academic, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical research laboratories.\"\n"}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/e6a2ceb0-afbf-4d6e-87a6-f5e89445dbcd.png", "/media/product_images/3ceb8eda-498c-4054-81b1-f77e7ba5c2e3.png", "/media/product_images/3e73e832-8397-4150-a9b1-b147068c975e.jpg", "/media/product_images/ce833981-c10e-49d1-ad84-5b432354ab97.jpg", "/media/product_images/b540b3e8-1f42-44ae-8d51-a29af4814730.jpg"], "manuals": [], "options": ["100Pcs/Package"], "createdAt": 1780979893063, "listPrice": "$170", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": [], "keyFeatures": ["\u2022 TC-Treated Surface", "\u2022 Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction", "\u2022 Flat-Bottom Well Design", "\u2022 Thin-Walled Wells for Enhanced Thermal Consistency", "\u2022 Protective Lid Included", "\u2022 Excellent Optical Clarity", "\u2022 Gamma Irradiated Sterility", "\u2022 Non-Pyrogenic, DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Human DNA-Free", "\u2022 Individually Packaged for Sterility and Convenience", "\u2022 Suitable for Cell Culture and Cell-Based Assays"], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {}, "catalogNumber": "BA076096", "performanceData": 