    (48, E'custom-1780978598488', E'15 mL Sterile Conical Centrifuge Tube, Rack Packed', E'BioArk Conical Sterile Centrifuge Tubes are manufactured from high-purity polypropylene (PP) resin and designed for reliable sample handling, storage, and centrifugation in molecular biology, clinical diagnostics, biotechnology, and biochemical research laboratories. The transparent construction provides excellent sample visibility, while the durable polypropylene material offers a safer and more practical alternative to glass tubes.

Produced using advanced molding technology, these centrifuge tubes deliver consistent performance, excellent chemical resistance, and dependable durability for routine laboratory workflows. Clear black graduations and a large white writing area enable accurate volume measurement and convenient sample identification, improving laboratory efficiency and traceability.

Available with either advanced screw caps or original plug-seal caps, BioArk centrifuge tubes provide secure sample containment during storage, transport, and centrifugation. Their high-quality construction and user-friendly design make them ideal for a wide range of research, clinical, and industrial laboratory applications.', E'/media/product_images/4c6d88c6-a42b-429a-bd47-85f0f2c4221a.webp', E'/reagents/15-ml-sterile-conical-centrifuge-tube-rack-packed', E'category-1780539818236', E'centrifuge Tubes', E'product', NULL, 1780978598488, '2026-06-08T23:16:38.488000+00:00', E'BA801152', E'In Stock', E'$102', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Clear Volume Graduations – High-contrast printed graduations provide accurate volume measurement and easy sample monitoring.', E'• Large Writing Area – Expanded white marking panel allows convenient sample labeling, identification, and traceability.', E'• High Centrifugation Performance – Designed to withstand centrifugal forces up to 12,000 × g for reliable sample processing.', E'• Sterile and Contaminant-Free – Certified sterile, non-pyrogenic, DNase-free, and RNase-free for sensitive biological and molecular applications.', E'• Secure Sample Storage – Ideal for the storage and handling of larger-volume samples, reagents, buffers, and biological solutions.', E'• Suitable for Cell Culture Workflows – Provides safe and reliable handling of culture media, cell suspensions, and related reagents.', E'• Optimized for Molecular Biology and Microbiology – Supports sample preparation, centrifugation, and routine laboratory processing.', E'• Convenient Reagent Preparation – Well suited for preparing master mixes, buffers, dilution series, and other laboratory solutions.', E'• Durable Polypropylene Construction – Manufactured from high-purity polypropylene for excellent chemical resistance, transparency, and durability.']::text[], ARRAY[E'500 Pcs/Case']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Sample Centrifugation and Processing – Ideal for high-speed centrifugation procedures used to separate, concentrate, and collect biological and chemical samples.

• Sample Storage and Preservation – Suitable for the short- and long-term storage of cells, biological specimens, reagents, buffers, and laboratory solutions.

• Sample Transport and Handling – Provides secure containment for the safe transport of samples between laboratories, workstations, and storage facilities.

• Cellular and Particle Separation – Supports the isolation and separation of cells, organelles, precipitates, proteins, nucleic acids, and other particulate materials.

• Molecular Biology Workflows – Commonly used for DNA/RNA extraction, nucleic acid purification, PCR sample preparation, and other molecular biology applications.

• Protein and Biochemistry Research – Suitable for protein precipitation, purification, sample preparation, and biochemical analysis procedures.

• Cell Culture and Microbiology Applications – Ideal for handling cell suspensions, culture media, microbial samples, and related laboratory workflows.

• Reagent Preparation and Mixing – Convenient for preparing, mixing, diluting, and storing laboratory reagents, buffers, and master mixes.

