    (59, E'custom-1780978262370', E'1.5 mL DNase/RNase-Free Microcentrifuge Tube', E'SnapLock MicroCentrifuge Tubes are designed for secure sample storage, processing, and centrifugation in molecular biology, cell biology, clinical, and research laboratories. Manufactured from high-quality polypropylene, these tubes provide excellent durability, chemical resistance, and reliable performance for a wide range of laboratory applications. The snap-lock cap design creates a secure seal to help prevent sample leakage, evaporation, and contamination during handling, storage, and centrifugation.

For convenient sample identification, each tube features a frosted cap surface and a large frosted writing panel on the side, allowing clear labeling and traceability. The cap incorporates a thin central membrane that enables easy sample access using a syringe needle without opening the tube, helping maintain sample integrity and reduce contamination risk.

Engineered to withstand centrifugation forces up to 14,000 × g, SnapLock Micro Centrifuge Tubes are suitable for routine sample preparation, storage, and separation workflows. Certified RNase-free, DNase-free, and non-pyrogenic, these tubes provide the purity and reliability required for sensitive molecular biology and life science applications.', E'/media/product_images/70ac4b6f-6f23-4694-bdfd-b5c185286fe7.webp', E'/reagents/1-5-ml-dnase-rnase-free-microcentrifuge-tube', E'category-1780539818236', E'centrifuge Tubes', E'product', NULL, 1780978262370, '2026-06-08T23:11:02.370000+00:00', E'BA801164', E'In Stock', E'$340', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Secure Snap-Lock Cap – Provides a reliable seal to minimize sample leakage, evaporation, and contamination.', E'• High Centrifugation Performance – Withstands forces up to 14,000 × g for routine laboratory applications.', E'• Easy Sample Identification – Frosted cap and side writing panel allow convenient labeling and tracking.', E'• Needle-Accessible Cap – Thin membrane in the cap enables sample access by syringe without opening the tube.', E'• High-Quality Polypropylene – Durable, chemically resistant, and suitable for a wide range of laboratory procedures.', E'• RNase-/DNase-Free – Ideal for sensitive DNA, RNA, and molecular biology applications.', E'• Non-Pyrogenic – Manufactured to support sample integrity and reduce contamination risks.', E'• Single-Piece Design – Integrated tube and cap for convenient handling and secure sample storage.']::text[], ARRAY[E'10 Packs/Case(5000 Pcs/Case)']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Sample Centrifugation and Separation – Ideal for the separation, sedimentation, and collection of cells, nucleic acids, proteins, and other biological materials during centrifugation procedures.

• PCR and Molecular Biology Workflows – Suitable for PCR, qPCR, DNA/RNA extraction, enzymatic reactions, and other molecular biology applications.

• Sample Storage and Preservation – Used for the short- and long-term storage of biological samples, reagents, enzymes, and nucleic acids.

• Chemical and Reagent Preparation – Convenient for mixing, diluting, and storing small volumes of laboratory reagents and chemical solutions.

• Protein Research Applications – Supports protein precipitation, purification, separation, and sample preparation workflows.

• High-Speed Centrifugation Procedures – Designed for applications requiring high centrifugal forces, including organelle isolation and macromolecule separation.

• Cell Biology and Microbiology Studies – Suitable for handling cell suspensions, microbial cultures, and other biological samples.

• Routine Laboratory Operations – Ideal for sample collection, aliquoting, transport, mixing, and general laboratory processing tasks.

• Clinical, Academic, and Research Laboratories – Widely used in life science research, biotechnology, diagnostics, pharmaceutical development, and quality control laboratories.', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/70ac4b6f-6f23-4694-bdfd-b5c185286fe7.webp', E'/media/product_images/613768de-30dd-4be4-8d1d-94d0ba44c717.webp', E'/media/product_images/a3ded695-0766-402b-b504-9e5bab235c6e.jpg', E'/media/product_images/2b228662-801f-4a4f-b904-62d997bf6bd4.jpg']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780978262370", "link": "/reagents/1-5-ml-dnase-rnase-free-microcentrifuge-tube", "name": "1.5 mL DNase/RNase-Free Microcentrifuge Tube", "category": "category-1780539818236", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1780978262370, "groupName": "centrifuge Tubes", "description": "SnapLock MicroCentrifuge Tubes are designed for secure sample storage, processing, and centrifugation in molecular biology, cell biology, clinical, and research laboratories. Manufactured from high-quality polypropylene, these tubes provide excellent durability, chemical resistance, and reliable performance for a wide range of laboratory applications. The snap-lock cap design creates a secure seal to help prevent sample leakage, evaporation, and contamination during handling, storage, and centrifugation.\n\nFor convenient sample identification, each tube features a frosted cap surface and a large frosted writing panel on the side, allowing clear labeling and traceability. The cap incorporates a thin central membrane that enables easy sample access using a syringe needle without opening the tube, helping maintain sample integrity and reduce contamination risk.\n\nEngineered to withstand centrifugation forces up to 14,000 \u00d7 g, SnapLock Micro Centrifuge Tubes are suitable for routine sample preparation, storage, and separation workflows. Certified RNase-free, DNase-free, and non-pyrogenic, these tubes provide the purity and reliability required for sensitive molecular biology and life science applications."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/70ac4b6f-6f23-4694-bdfd-b5c185286fe7.webp", "/media/product_images/613768de-30dd-4be4-8d1d-94d0ba44c717.webp", "/media/product_images/a3ded695-0766-402b-b504-9e5bab235c6e.jpg", "/media/product_images/2b228662-801f-4a4f-b904-62d997bf6bd4.jpg"], "manuals": [], "options": ["10 Packs/Case(5000 Pcs/Case)"], "createdAt": 1780978262370, "listPrice": "$340", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": [], "keyFeatures": ["\u2022 Secure Snap-Lock Cap \u2013 Provides a reliable seal to minimize sample leakage, evaporation, and contamination.", "\u2022 High Centrifugation Performance \u2013 Withstands forces up to 14,000 \u00d7 g for routine laboratory applications.", "\u2022 Easy Sample Identification \u2013 Frosted cap and side writing panel allow convenient labeling and tracking.", "\u2022 Needle-Accessible Cap \u2013 Thin membrane in the cap enables sample access by syringe without opening the tube.", "\u2022 High-Quality Polypropylene \u2013 Durable, chemically resistant, and suitable for a wide range of laboratory procedures.", "\u2022 RNase-/DNase-Free \u2013 Ideal for sensitive DNA, RNA, and molecular biology applications.", "\u2022 Non-Pyrogenic \u2013 Manufactured to support sample integrity and reduce contamination risks.", "\u2022 Single-Piece Design \u2013 Integrated tube and cap for convenient handling and secure sample storage."], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {}, "catalogNumber": "BA801164", "performanceData": "\u2022 Sample Centrifugation and Separation \u2013 Ideal for the separation, sedimentation, and collection of cells, nucleic acids, proteins, and other biological materials during centrifugation procedures.\n\n\u2022 PCR and Molecular Biology Workflows \u2013 Suitable for PCR, qPCR, DNA/RNA extraction, enzymatic reactions, and other molecular biology applications.\n\n\u2022 Sample Storage and Preservation \u2013 Used for the short- and long-term storage of biological samples, reagents, enzymes, and nucleic acids.\n\n\u2022 Chemical and Reagent Preparation \u2013 Convenient for mixing, diluting, and storing small volumes of laboratory reagents and chemical solutions.\n\n\u2022 Protein Research Applications \u2013 Supports protein precipitation, purification, separation, and sample preparation workflows.\n\n\u2022 High-Speed Centrifugation Procedures \u2013 Designed for applications requiring high centrifugal forces, including organelle isolation and macromolecule separation.\n\n\u2022 Cell Biology and Microbiology Studies \u2013 Suitable for handling cell suspensions, microbial cultures, and other biological samples.\n\n\u2022 Routine Laboratory Operations \u2013 Ideal for sample collection, aliquoting, transport, mixing, and general laboratory processing tasks.\n\n\u2022 Clinical, Academic, and Research Laboratories \u2013 Widely used in life science research, biotechnology, diagnostics, pharmaceutical development, and quality control laboratories.", "storageStability": "", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (60, E'custom-1780979637860', E'6-Well Tissue Culture-Treated Cell Culture Plate, Sterile', E'BioArk Multiwell Cell Culture Plates are manufactured from premium virgin polystyrene (PS) and feature a tissue culture (TC)-treated surface to promote consistent cell attachment, growth, and proliferation. Designed with flat-bottom wells and supplied with a matching lid, these plates provide an ideal environment for routine cell culture, drug screening, cell-based assays, and other life science research applications.

The precision-engineered plate design helps minimize the impact of external environmental factors while maintaining optimal culture conditions. Thin-walled well bottoms improve thermal consistency across the plate, reducing edge effects and supporting more uniform experimental results. The optically clear flat-bottom wells provide excellent visibility for microscopic observation, imaging, and sample analysis.

Each plate is gamma irradiated and certified non-pyrogenic, DNase-free, RNase-free, and human DNA-free to ensure the highest level of purity for sensitive cell culture and biological research workflows. Manufactured under strict quality standards, BioArk Multiwell Culture Plates offer reliable performance, excellent optical clarity, and consistent results for academic, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical research laboratories.', E'/media/product_images/915469c4-5957-47c3-9df6-a9d67b959606.jpg', E'/reagents/6-well-tissue-culture-treated-cell-culture-plate-sterile', E'category-1780539818236', E'Cell Culture Plate', E'product', NULL, 1780979637860, '2026-06-08T23:33:57.860000+00:00', E'BA076006', E'In Stock', E'$170', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• TC-Treated Surface', E'• Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction', E'• Flat-Bottom Well Design', E'• Thin-Walled Wells for Enhanced Thermal Consistency', E'• Protective Lid Included', E'• Excellent Optical Clarity', E'• Gamma Irradiated Sterility', E'• Non-Pyrogenic, DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Human DNA-Free', E'• Individually Packaged for Sterility and Convenience', E'• Suitable for Cell Culture and Cell-Based Assays']::text[], ARRAY[E'100Pcs/Package']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Adherent Cell Culture

