    (74, E'custom-1772243282870', E'Prestained Protein Marker 250KD (10-250KD)', E'•	The Prestained Protein Marker 250 kDa is formulated with high-purity recombinant proteins and distinct multi-color reference bands, covering a broad molecular weight range of 10–250 kDa. A green 10 kDa band and orange-red bands at 25 kDa and 70 kDa, with remaining bands in blue, provide clear orientation and accurate molecular weight estimation. This ladder requires no heating, reducing agents, or sample buffer, minimizing hands-on time and improving experimental consistency. 
•	Performance is equivalent to Thermo Scientific PageRuler™ Plus Prestained Protein Ladder (Cat. 26619), while offering comparable quality at less than half the cost, delivering exceptional value for both routine and high-throughput workflows.', E'/media/product_images/4f36cf0e-7ff2-4650-bb1e-2b550ac5bbcc.png', E'/reagents/prestained-protein-marker-250kd-10-250kd', E'category-1766675365489', E'', E'product', NULL, 1772243282870, '2026-02-27T20:48:02.870000+00:00', E'BAPM1126', E'In Stock', E'$60', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'(~10, ~15, ~25, ~35, ~55, ~70, ~100, ~130, ~250)kDa', E'with orange-red band at 25Kda and 70 kDa, green band at 10 kD']::text[], ARRAY[E'500μL', E'2 X 500μL', E'5 X 500μL']::text[], E'{"500\u03bcL": "$60", "2 X 500\u03bcL": "$110", "5 X 500\u03bcL": "$250"}'::jsonb, E'Ship with wet ice; Store at -20°C; Valid for 12 months', E'', E'', ARRAY[E'BAPM1126 Manual', E'BAPM1125 Manual']::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/f4771a52-a6ed-4c0b-a961-296a41bc73a6.pdf']::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/4f36cf0e-7ff2-4650-bb1e-2b550ac5bbcc.png', E'/media/product_images/9056dc01-a706-4ea1-a54b-7f3215f1ea8f.png', E'/media/product_images/aa5afc91-8a4c-40da-9fab-d12d4406cc39.png']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1772243282870", "link": "/reagents/prestained-protein-marker-250kd-10-250kd", "name": "Prestained Protein Marker 250KD (10-250KD)", "category": "category-1766675365489", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1772243282870, "description": "\u2022\tThe Prestained Protein Marker 250 kDa is formulated with high-purity recombinant proteins and distinct multi-color reference bands, covering a broad molecular weight range of 10\u2013250 kDa. A green 10 kDa band and orange-red bands at 25 kDa and 70 kDa, with remaining bands in blue, provide clear orientation and accurate molecular weight estimation. This ladder requires no heating, reducing agents, or sample buffer, minimizing hands-on time and improving experimental consistency. \n\u2022\tPerformance is equivalent to Thermo Scientific PageRuler\u2122 Plus Prestained Protein Ladder (Cat. 26619), while offering comparable quality at less than half the cost, delivering exceptional value for both routine and high-throughput workflows."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/4f36cf0e-7ff2-4650-bb1e-2b550ac5bbcc.png", "/media/product_images/9056dc01-a706-4ea1-a54b-7f3215f1ea8f.png", "/media/product_images/aa5afc91-8a4c-40da-9fab-d12d4406cc39.png"], "manuals": ["BAPM1126 Manual", "BAPM1125 Manual"], "options": ["500\u03bcL", "2 X 500\u03bcL", "5 X 500\u03bcL"], "createdAt": 1772243282870, "listPrice": "$60", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": ["/media/product_images/f4771a52-a6ed-4c0b-a961-296a41bc73a6.pdf"], "keyFeatures": ["(~10, ~15, ~25, ~35, ~55, ~70, ~100, ~130, ~250)kDa", "with orange-red band at 25Kda and 70 kDa, green band at 10 kD"], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {"500\u03bcL": "$60", "2 X 500\u03bcL": "$110", "5 X 500\u03bcL": "$250"}, "catalogNumber": "BAPM1126", "performanceData": "", "storageStability": "Ship with wet ice; Store at -20\u00b0C; Valid for 12 months", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (75, E'custom-1780977963735', E'50 mL Individually Wrapped Serological Pipette, Filtered', E'BioArk 50 mL Polystyrene Sterile Serological Pipettes are designed to provide accurate liquid measurement and transfer for a wide range of laboratory applications. Manufactured from high-clarity polystyrene, these disposable pipettes offer excellent visibility for precise volume reading and reliable performance in cell culture, molecular biology, microbiology, clinical diagnostics, and pharmaceutical research. Their precision-molded construction ensures consistent liquid handling and dependable results across routine laboratory workflows.

Each pipette is individually wrapped and sterilized by gamma irradiation or E-beam processing to maintain sterility and support aseptic techniques. Certified RNase-free, DNase-free, and non-pyrogenic, these pipettes help minimize the risk of sample contamination, making them suitable for sensitive biological and diagnostic applications. Clear, bidirectional graduations and highly visible color-coded markings enable fast volume identification and accurate dispensing, improving workflow efficiency and user convenience.

Designed for seamless compatibility with most standard pipette controllers and pipette aids, Biofargo serological pipettes provide a convenient, cost-effective solution for daily laboratory liquid handling. Their combination of accuracy, sterility, and ease of use makes them an ideal choice for research, clinical, and industrial laboratory environments.', E'/media/product_images/0a00399c-0c48-4b01-809e-319dd38436e6.webp', E'/reagents/50-ml-individually-wrapped-serological-pipette-filtered', E'category-1780539818236', E'Serological Pipettes', E'product', NULL, 1780977963735, '2026-06-08T23:06:03.735000+00:00', E'BA804050', E'In Stock', E'$240', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Sterile and Ready for Immediate Use – Individually packaged and sterilized by E-beam or gamma irradiation to ensure aseptic handling and minimize contamination risk.', E'• Precise Liquid Measurement and Transfer – Calibrated 2 mL capacity with clear, bidirectional graduations for accurate aspiration and dispensing.', E'• Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction – Manufactured from high-clarity polystyrene for excellent transparency, reliable performance, and enhanced chemical resistance.', E'• Certified Free of Biological Contaminants – RNase-free, DNase-free, non-pyrogenic, and non-cytotoxic, making the pipettes suitable for sensitive research and diagnostic applications.', E'• Easy Volume Identification – Distinctive color-coded markings enable rapid size recognition and improve laboratory workflow efficiency.', E'• Broad Instrument Compatibility – Designed to fit most standard pipette controllers and pipette aids commonly used in research, clinical, and industrial laboratories.', E'• Single-Use Disposable Design – Eliminates cleaning requirements and helps reduce sample carryover, cross-contamination, and experimental variability.', E'• Optimized for Laboratory Workflows – Ideal for cell culture, microbiology, molecular biology, clinical diagnostics, and general liquid handling applications.']::text[], ARRAY[E'5 Packs/Case(400 Pcs/Case)']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Cell Culture and Tissue Culture Workflows – Accurate transfer of culture media, buffers, reagents, and cell suspensions in routine cell-based applications.

• Clinical and Diagnostic Testing – Reliable liquid handling for sample preparation, assay setup, and laboratory diagnostic procedures.

• Biotechnology and Pharmaceutical Research – Suitable for drug discovery, bioprocess development, formulation studies, and other research applications.

• Microbiology and Bacteriology Studies – Precise measurement and transfer of microbial cultures, growth media, and laboratory reagents.

• Sample Preparation and Reagent Mixing – Efficient handling, dilution, mixing, and dispensing of biological and chemical solutions.

• Molecular Biology and Life Science Research – Ideal for routine laboratory workflows involving nucleic acids, proteins, enzymes, and other biological samples.

• Quality Control and Analytical Laboratories – Consistent liquid transfer for testing, validation, and quality assurance procedures across research and manufacturing environments.', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/0a00399c-0c48-4b01-809e-319dd38436e6.webp', E'/media/product_images/c6af283d-a68e-4a0c-9792-a355ac12913d.JPG', E'/media/product_images/d7bea584-9fce-42d3-9347-c219ce090dd9.JPG', E'/media/product_images/215b23bf-74d2-40cb-9763-ebaef01c2a6d.JPG']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780977963735", "link": "/reagents/50-ml-individually-wrapped-serological-pipette-filtered", "name": "50 mL Individually Wrapped Serological Pipette, Filtered", "category": "category-1780539818236", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1780977963735, "groupName": "Serological Pipettes", "description": "BioArk 50 mL Polystyrene Sterile Serological Pipettes are designed to provide accurate liquid measurement and transfer for a wide range of laboratory applications. Manufactured from high-clarity polystyrene, these disposable pipettes offer excellent visibility for precise volume reading and reliable performance in cell culture, molecular biology, microbiology, clinical diagnostics, and pharmaceutical research. Their precision-molded construction ensures consistent liquid handling and dependable results across routine laboratory workflows.\n\nEach pipette is individually wrapped and sterilized by gamma irradiation or E-beam processing to maintain sterility and support aseptic techniques. Certified RNase-free, DNase-free, and non-pyrogenic, these pipettes help minimize the risk of sample contamination, making them suitable for sensitive biological and diagnostic applications. Clear, bidirectional graduations and highly visible color-coded markings enable fast volume identification and accurate dispensing, improving workflow efficiency and user convenience.\n\nDesigned for seamless compatibility with most standard pipette controllers and pipette aids, Biofargo serological pipettes provide a convenient, cost-effective solution for daily laboratory liquid handling. Their combination of accuracy, sterility, and ease of use makes them an ideal choice for research, clinical, and industrial laboratory environments."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/0a00399c-0c48-4b01-809e-319dd38436e6.webp", "/media/product_images/c6af283d-a68e-4a0c-9792-a355ac12913d.JPG", "/media/product_images/d7bea584-9fce-42d3-9347-c219ce090dd9.JPG", "/media/product_images/215b23bf-74d2-40cb-9763-ebaef01c2a6d.JPG"], "manuals": [], "options": ["5 Packs/Case(400 Pcs/Case)"], "createdAt": 1780977963735, "listPrice": "$240", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": [], "keyFeatures": ["\u2022 Sterile and Ready for Immediate Use \u2013 Individually packaged and sterilized by E-beam or gamma irradiation to ensure aseptic handling and minimize contamination risk.", "\u2022 Precise Liquid Measurement and Transfer \u2013 Calibrated 2 mL capacity with clear, bidirectional graduations for accurate aspiration and dispensing.", "\u2022 Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction \u2013 Manufactured from high-clarity polystyrene for excellent transparency, reliable performance, and enhanced chemical resistance.", "\u2022 Certified Free of Biological Contaminants \u2013 RNase-free, DNase-free, non-pyrogenic, and non-cytotoxic, making the pipettes suitable for sensitive research and diagnostic applications.", "\u2022 Easy Volume Identification \u2013 Distinctive color-coded markings enable rapid size recognition and improve laboratory workflow efficiency.", "\u2022 Broad Instrument Compatibility \u2013 Designed to fit most standard pipette controllers and pipette aids commonly used in research, clinical, and industrial laboratories.", "\u2022 Single-Use Disposable Design \u2013 Eliminates cleaning requirements and helps reduce sample carryover, cross-contamination, and experimental variability.", "\u2022 Optimized for Laboratory Workflows \u2013 Ideal for cell culture, microbiology, molecular biology, clinical diagnostics, and general liquid handling applications."], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {}, "catalogNumber": "BA804050", "performanceData": "\u2022 Cell Culture and Tissue Culture Workflows \u2013 Accurate transfer of culture media, buffers, reagents, and cell suspensions in routine cell-based applications.\n\n\u2022 Clinical and Diagnostic Testing \u2013 Reliable liquid handling for sample preparation, assay setup, and laboratory diagnostic procedures.\n\n\u2022 Biotechnology and Pharmaceutical Research \u2013 Suitable for drug discovery, bioprocess development, formulation studies, and other research applications.\n\n\u2022 Microbiology and Bacteriology Studies \u2013 Precise measurement and transfer of microbial cultures, growth media, and laboratory reagents.\n\n\u2022 Sample Preparation and Reagent Mixing \u2013 Efficient handling, dilution, mixing, and dispensing of biological and chemical solutions.\n\n\u2022 Molecular Biology and Life Science Research \u2013 Ideal for routine laboratory workflows involving nucleic acids, proteins, enzymes, and other biological samples.\n\n\u2022 Quality Control and Analytical Laboratories \u2013 Consistent liquid transfer for testing, validation, and quality assurance procedures across research and manufacturing environments.", "storageStability": "", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (76, E'custom-1780979224342', E'90 × 15 mm Sterile Petri Dish', E'BioArk 90 × 15 mm Sterile Petri Dishes are manufactured from high-quality virgin polystyrene (PS) and designed for reliable microbial culture, isolation, and observation in research, clinical, industrial, and educational laboratories. The crystal-clear construction provides excellent visibility for monitoring colony growth, morphology, and contamination, making these dishes ideal for a wide range of microbiological applications.

The precision-molded 90 mm diameter and 15 mm height design offers a standardized culture surface suitable for bacterial, fungal, and yeast cultivation. The flat growth surface promotes even distribution of culture media and samples, while the secure-fitting lid helps reduce contamination and moisture loss during incubation.

Sterilized by gamma irradiation and produced under strict quality control standards, BioArk Petri Dishes are ready for immediate use and provide dependable performance for routine laboratory workflows. Their disposable design eliminates the need for cleaning and re-sterilization, improving efficiency and minimizing cross-contamination risks. These dishes are widely used for microbiological testing, environmental monitoring, quality control, food safety analysis, and life science research.', E'/media/product_images/388e403b-f3f8-4bb4-9fd8-b8a38ab19b8a.jpg', E'/reagents/90-15-mm-sterile-petri-dish', E'category-1780539818236', E'Bacterial Culture plate', E'product', NULL, 1780979224342, '2026-06-08T23:27:04.342000+00:00', E'BAAB1001', E'In Stock', E'$129', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'BioArk 90 × 15 mm Sterile Petri Dishes are manufactured from high-quality virgin polystyrene (PS) and designed for reliable microbial culture, isolation, and observation in research, clinical, industrial, and educational laboratories. The crystal-clear construction provides excellent visibility for monitoring colony growth, morphology, and contamination, making these dishes ideal for a wide range of microbiological applications.', E'The precision-molded 90 mm diameter and 15 mm height design offers a standardized culture surface suitable for bacterial, fungal, and yeast cultivation. The flat growth surface promotes even distribution of culture media and samples, while the secure-fitting lid helps reduce contamination and moisture loss during incubation.', E'Sterilized by gamma irradiation and produced under strict quality control standards, BioArk Petri Dishes are ready for immediate use and provide dependable performance for routine laboratory workflows. Their disposable design eliminates the need for cleaning and re-sterilization, improving efficiency and minimizing cross-contamination risks. These dishes are widely used for microbiological testing, environmental monitoring, quality control, food safety analysis, and life science research.']::text[], ARRAY[E'500 Pcs/Case']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Manufactured from High-Quality Virgin Polystyrene (PS)

