s requiring high centrifugal forces, including organelle isolation and macromolecule separation.\\n\\n\\u2022 Cell Biology and Microbiology Studies \\u2013 Suitable for handling cell suspensions, microbial cultures, and other biological samples.\\n\\n\\u2022 Routine Laboratory Operations \\u2013 Ideal for sample collection, aliquoting, transport, mixing, and general laboratory processing tasks.\\n\\n\\u2022 Clinical, Academic, and Research Laboratories \\u2013 Widely used in life science research, biotechnology, diagnostics, pharmaceutical development, and quality control laboratories.", "storageStability": "", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (44, E'custom-1765069552410', E'NEWBioStock', E'', E'/media/product_images/feddd056-c26b-4b51-bedd-1469b38a235e.png', E'/reagents/newbiostock', E'category-1765063995229', E'', E'product', 1, 1765069552410, '2025-12-06T20:05:52.410000+00:00', E'BADM3367', E'In Stock', E'$39', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'10 linear double-stranded DNA (100 bp, 200 bp, 300 bp, 400 bp, 500 bp, 600 bp, 700 bp, 800 bp, 900 bp, 1000 bp) bands']::text[], ARRAY[E'500ul', E'2 X 500ul', E'5 X 500ul']::text[], E'{"500ul": "$39", "2 X 500ul": "$75", "5 X 500ul": "$175"}'::jsonb, E'Ship with wet ice; Store at -20℃; valid for 24 months', E'', E'', ARRAY[E'BADM3367 Manual', E'BADM3362 GN8K DNA Marker']::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/dac58c13-5b72-475c-8ecd-bc9b01b6b462.pdf']::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/feddd056-c26b-4b51-bedd-1469b38a235e.png', E'/media/product_images/1f42655b-a02e-45cb-bbc8-d964a0600a68.png', E'/media/product_images/9119af69-c30d-447b-bf75-ddded54658d9.png']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1765069552410", "link": "/reagents/newbiostock", "name": "NEWBioStock", "order": 1, "category": "category-1765063995229", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1765069552410, "description": ""}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/feddd056-c26b-4b51-bedd-1469b38a235e.png", "/media/product_images/1f42655b-a02e-45cb-bbc8-d964a0600a68.png", "/media/product_images/9119af69-c30d-447b-bf75-ddded54658d9.png"], "manuals": ["BADM3367 Manual", "BADM3362 GN8K DNA Marker"], "options": ["500ul", "2 X 500ul", "5 X 500ul"], "createdAt": 1765069552410, "listPrice": "$39", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": true, "manualUrls": ["/media/product_images/dac58c13-5b72-475c-8ecd-bc9b01b6b462.pdf"], "keyFeatures": ["10 linear double-stranded DNA (100 bp, 200 bp, 300 bp, 400 bp, 500 bp, 600 bp, 700 bp, 800 bp, 900 bp, 1000 bp) bands"], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {"500ul": "$39", "2 X 500ul