te Tips are manufactured from high-quality polypropylene (PP) to provide reliable performance, precision liquid handling, and enhanced sample protection for a wide range of laboratory workflows. Designed for both single-channel and multi-channel pipettes, these tips offer broad compatibility with most major pipette brands, including Eppendorf, Gilson, Thermo Fisher, Sartorius, Biohit, Oxford, DLAB, and other standard pipette systems.\\n\\nFeaturing an integrated aerosol barrier filter and low-retention surface technology, these tips help minimize the risk of cross-contamination, liquid backflow, and pipette contamination while maximizing sample recovery. The low-retention design reduces liquid adhesion, improving pipetting accuracy and consistency, particularly when working with valuable or low-volume samples.\\n\\nAs one of the most widely used pipette tip formats in research, clinical, and diagnostic laboratories, these universal filtered tips provide a cost-effective solution for routine liquid handling applications while maintaining high standards of quality and performance. Please note that Rainin pipettes require specially designed tips and are not compatible with standard universal pipette tips. Users of less common pipette brands are encouraged to verify compatibility prior to purchase."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/a2e7555f-0f9d-4d76-a670-9d6f5747ff56.webp", "/media/product_images/1c154f9f-992b-4c18-afa3-c1e322542955.webp", "/media/product_images/2027218a-fdb4-4b77-bb0e-4516d332d149.webp", "/media/product_images/5869ff3b-17f5-4118-baa1-f0a9341c0440.webp", "/media/product_images/3b479d0e-f23b-4226-9b46-27956319efdb.webp"], "manuals": [], "options": ["10 Racks/Box; 5 Boxes/Case (4800Tips/Case)"], "createdAt": 1780975837520, "listPrice": "$250", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": [], "keyFeatures": ["\\u2022 Low-Retention Surface for Enhanced Sample Recovery and Pipetting Accuracy", "\\u