g, SNP analysis, and other genomics applications.\\n\\n\\u2022 Mutation Detection and Molecular Diagnostics \\u2013 Supports mutation screening, genetic testing, and clinical diagnostic workflows requiring high sensitivity and reproducibility.\\n\\n\\u2022 Molecular Biology and Cloning Procedures \\u2013 Commonly used in cloning, plasmid analysis, DNA/RNA processing, and routine molecular biology experiments.\\n\\n\\u2022 Next-Generation Sequencing (NGS) Sample Preparation \\u2013 Ideal for nucleic acid preparation, library construction, amplification, and other pre-sequencing workflows.\\n\\n\\u2022 Academic, Clinical, and Biotechnology Research \\u2013 Widely used in research laboratories, diagnostic facilities, pharmaceutical development, and biotechnology applications.", "storageStability": "", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (68, E'custom-1781002164496', E'2.0 mL Sterile Cryogenic Vial', E'BioArk Cryogenic Vial Combo Sets are designed for the secure storage and preservation of biological samples under demanding laboratory conditions. Available in 0.5 mL, 1.5 mL, and 2.0 mL volumes, these cryovials provide a versatile solution for sample collection, storage, transport, and long-term cryopreservation across a wide range of research and clinical applications.\n\nManufactured from premium medical-grade polypropylene, the vials offer excellent durability and chemical resistance, withstanding temperatures from -86°C to 121°C as well as repeated freeze-thaw cycles. Their universal screw-thread design ensures secure sealing and compatibility with standard laboratory storage systems, while the self-standing base provides added convenience during sample handling and processing.\n\nTo ensure sample integrity, each vial is radiation sterilized and certified free of DNase, RNase, pyrogens, and other common contaminants. Combining reliable performance, temperature resistance, and convenient handling, BioArk Cryogenic Vials are an ideal choice for biobanking, cell culture, molecular biology, clinical diagnostics, and long-term sample storage applications.', E'/media/product_images/75fb9882-b3d9-42f0-91b5-27a4584038c1.webp', E'/reagents/2-0-ml-sterile-cryogenic-vial', E'category-1780539818236', E'Cryogenic Storage', E'product', NULL, 1781002164496, '2026-06-09T05:49:24.496000+00:00', E'BA817204', E'In Stock', E'$115', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Manufactured from Premium Medical-Grade Polypropylene', E'• Autoclavable up to 121°C for Sterilization and Reuse', E'• Withstands Temperatures as Low as -86°C for Long-Term Cryogenic Storage', E'• Designed to Endure Repeated Freeze-Thaw Cycles Without Compromising Performance', E'• Universal Screw-Thread Design for Secure Sealing and Easy Handling', E'• Self-Standing Base for Convenient Sample Processing and Storage', E'• Compatible with Most Standard Cryogenic Storage Boxes and Common Centrifuge Rotors', E'• Radiation Sterilized and Ready-to-Use', E'• Certified DNase-Free, RNase-Free, Endotoxin-Free, and Human DNA-Free', E'• Ideal for Sample Storage, Transport, and Cryopreservation Applications', E'• OEM and Custom Manufacturing Services Available']::text[], ARRAY[E'2000 Pcs/Case']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Cryogenic Sample Storage – Ideal for the long-term preservation of biological samples, cells, tissues, and reagents at temperatures as low as −86°C.\n\n• Cell Culture and Biobanking – Suitable for storing cell stocks, cell suspensions, and valuable research samples in biobanks and cell repositories.\n\n• Molecular Biology Workflows – Supports the storage and handling of DNA, RNA, proteins, enzymes, PCR products, and other sensitive biological materials.\n\n• Clinical and Diagnostic Sample Management – Provides secure storage and transport of clinical specimens, reference materials, and diagnostic samples.\n\n• Freeze-Thaw and Sterilization Processes – Designed to withstand repeated freeze-thaw cycles and autoclaving at 121°C for routine laboratory workflows.\n\n• Research and Laboratory Sample Storage – Compatible with standard cryogenic storage systems, freezer boxes, and laboratory equipment for organized sample management.', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/75fb9882-b3d9-42f0-91b5-27a4584038c1.webp', E'/media/product_images/c9d4b2ae-2622-4202-9929-e32f465bcfd0.webp', E'/media/product_images/b63e62e3-05e0-4e8e-9fa1-b6fb7920fcfe.jpg', E'/media/product_images/ee29185f-416f-4b43-84d6-dfa11cb50287.webp']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1781002164496", "link": "/reagents/2-0-ml-sterile-cryogenic-vial", "name": "2.0 mL Sterile Cryogenic Vial", "category": "category-1780539818236", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1781002164496, "groupName": "Cryogenic Storage", "description": "BioArk Cryogenic Vial Combo Sets are designed for the secure storage and preservation of biological samples under demanding laboratory conditions. Available in 0.5 mL, 1.5 mL, and 2.0 mL volumes, these cryovials provide a versatile solution for sample collection, storage, transport, and long-term cryopreservation across a wide range of research and clinical applications.\\n\\nManufactured from premium medical-grade polypropylene, the vials offer excellent durability and chemical resistance, withstanding temperatures from -86\\u00b0C to 121\\u00b0C as well as repeated freeze-thaw cycles. Their universal screw-thread design ensures secure sealing and compatibility with standard laboratory storage systems, while the self-standing base provides added convenience during sample handling and processing.\\n\\nTo ensure sample integrity, each vial is radiation sterilized and certified free of DNase, RNase, pyrogens, and other common contaminants. Combining reliable performance, temperature resistance, and convenient handling, BioArk Cryogenic Vials are an ideal choice for biobanking, cell culture, molecular biology, clinical diagnostics, and long-term sample storage applications."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/75fb9882-b3d9-42f0-91b5-27a4584038c1.webp", "/media/product_images/c9d4b2ae-2622-4202-9929-e32f465bcfd0.webp", "/media/product_images/b63e62e3-05e0-4e8e-9fa1-b6fb7920fcfe.jpg", "/media/product_images/ee29185f-416f-4b43-84d6-dfa11cb50287.webp"], "manuals": [], "options": ["2000 Pcs/Case"], "createdAt": 1781002164496, "listPrice": "$115", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": [], "keyFeatures": ["\\u2022 Manufactured from Premium Medical-Grade Polypropylene", "\\u2022 Autoclavable up to 121\\u00b0C for Sterilization and Reuse", "\\u2022 Withstands Temperatures as Low as -86\\u00b0C for Long-Term Cryogenic Storage", "\\u2022 Designed to Endure Repeated Freeze-Thaw Cycles Without Compromising Performance", "\\u2022 Universal Screw-Thread Design for Secure Sealing and Easy Handling", "\\u2022 Self-Standing Base for Convenient Sample Processing and Storage", "\\u2022 Compatible with Most Standard Cryogenic Storage Boxes and Common Centrifuge Rotors", "\\u2022 Radiation Sterilized and Ready-to-Use", "\\u2022 Certified DNase-Free, RNase-Free, Endotoxin-Free, and Human DNA-Free", "\\u2022 Ideal for Sample Storage, Transport, and Cryopreservation Applications", "\\u2022 OEM and Custom Manufacturing Services Available"], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {}, "catalogNumber": "BA817204", "performanceData": "\\u2022 Cryogenic Sample Storage \\u2013 Ideal for the long-term preservation of biological samples, cells, tissues, and reagents at temperatures as low as \\u221286\\u00b0C.\\n\\n\\u2022 Cell Culture and Biobanking \\u2013 Suitable for storing cell stocks, cell suspensions, and valuable research samples in biobanks and cell repositories.\\n\\n\\u2022 Molecular Biology Workflows \\u2013 Supports the storage and handling of DNA, RNA, proteins, enzymes, PCR products, and other sensitive biological materials.\\n\\n\\u2022 Clinical and Diagnostic Sample Management \\u2013 Provides secure storage and transport of clinical specimens, reference materials, and diagnostic samples.\\n\\n\\u2022 Freeze-Thaw and Sterilization Processes \\u2013 Designed to withstand repeated freeze-thaw cycles and autoclaving at 121\\u00b0C for routine laboratory workflows.\\n\\n\\u2022 Research and Laboratory Sample Storage \\u2013 Compatible with standard cryogenic storage systems, freezer boxes, and laboratory equipment for organized sample management.", "storageStability": "", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (69, E'custom-1772227271829', E'Prestained Protein Marker 180KD (10-180KD)', E'• The Prestained Protein Marker 180 kDa contains 10 highly pure, pre-stained recombinant proteins spanning 10–180 kDa, providing a reliable molecular weight standard for SDS-PAGE and Western blotting. The ladder features distinct multi-color bands—a green 10 kDa band and a pink 70 kDa reference band, with remaining bands in blue—allowing easy band identification, real-time electrophoresis tracking, and efficient transfer assessment. <br>\n• It offers performance equivalent to Thermo Scientific PageRuler™ Prestained Protein Ladder (Cat. 26617) at less than half the price, making it a cost-effective alternative for routine and high-throughput applications.', E'/media/product_images/6a1fc0e2-3144-4d49-84eb-a85a93f888c5.png', E'/reagents/prestained-protein-marker-180kd-10-180kd', E'category-1766675365489', E'', E'product', NULL, 1772227271829, '2026-02-27T16:21:11.829000+00:00', E'BAPM1125', E'In Stock', E'$60', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'(~10, ~15, ~25, ~35, ~40, ~55, ~70, ~100, ~130, ~180 kDa),']::text[], ARRAY[E'500μL', E'2 X 500μL', E'5 X 500μL']::text[], E'{"500\\u03bcL": "$60", "2 X 500\\u03bcL": "$110", "5 X 500\\u03bcL": "$250"}'::jsonb, E'Ship with wet ice; Store at -20℃, valid for 12 months.', E'', E'', ARRAY[E'BAPM1125 Manual']::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/d398a177-34e1-429f-9db2-bb234d5e5823.pdf']::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/6a1fc0e2-3144-4d49-84eb-a85a93f888c5.png', E'/media/product_images/27298605-2589-46fb-ba61-b58c8457167b.png', E'/media/product_images/171beb19-76cb-40ed-9994-2d5fbf813a96.png']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1772227271829", "link": "/reagents/prestained-protein-marker-180kd-10-180kd", "name": "Prestained Protein Marker 180KD (10-180KD)", "category": "category-1766675365489", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1772227271829, "description": "\\u2022 The Prestained Protein Marker 180 kDa contains 10 highly pure, pre-stained recombinant proteins spanning 10\\u2013180 kDa, providing a reliable molecular weight standard for SDS-PAGE and Western blotting. The ladder features distinct multi-color bands\\u2014a green 10 kDa band and a pink 70 kDa reference band, with remaining bands in blue\\u2014allowing easy band identification, real-time electrophoresis tracking, and efficient transfer assessment. <br>\\n\\u2022 It offers performance equivalent to Thermo Scientific PageRuler\\u2122 Prestained Protein Ladder (Cat. 26617) at less than half the price, making it a cost-effective alternative for routine and high-throughput applications."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/6a1fc0e2-3144-4d49-84eb-a85a93f888c5.png", "/media/product_images/27298605-2589-46fb-ba61-b58c8457167b.png", "/media/product_images/171beb19-76cb-40ed-9994-2d5fbf813a96.png"], "manuals": ["BAPM1125 Manual"], "options": ["500\\u03bcL", "2 X 500\\u03bcL", "5 X 500\\u03bcL"], "createdAt": 1772227271829, "listPrice": "$60", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": ["/media/product_images/d398a177-34e1-429f-9db2-bb234d5e5823.pdf"], "keyFeatures": ["(~10, ~15, ~25, ~35, ~40, ~55, ~70, ~100, ~130, ~180 kDa),"], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {"500\\u03bcL": "$60", "2 X 500\\u03bcL": "$110", "5 X 500\\u03bcL": "$250"}, "catalogNumber": "BAPM1125", "performanceData": "", "storageStability": "Ship with wet ice; Store at -20\\u2103, valid for 12 months.", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (70, E'custom-1780979981743', E'96-Well Tissue Culture-Treated Cell Culture Plate, Sterile', E'BioArk Multiwell Cell Culture Plates are manufactured from premium virgin polystyrene (PS) and feature a tissue culture (TC)-treated surface to promote consistent cell attachment, growth, and proliferation. Designed with flat-bottom wells and supplied with a matching lid, these plates provide an ideal environment for routine cell culture, drug screening, cell-based assays, and other life science research applications.\n\nThe precision-engineered plate design helps minimize the impact of external environmental factors while maintaining optimal culture conditions. Thin-walled well bottoms improve thermal consistency across the plate, reducing edge effects and supporting more uniform experimental results. The optically clear flat-bottom wells provide excellent visibility for microscopic observation, imaging, and sample analysis.\n\nEach plate is gamma irradiated and certified non-pyrogenic, DNase-free, RNase-free, and human DNA-free to ensure the highest level of purity for sensitive cell culture and biological research workflows. Manufactured under strict quality standards, BioArk Multiwell Culture Plates offer reliable performance, excellent optical clarity, and consistent results for academic, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical research laboratories.', E'/media/product_images/1774be7f-069c-411f-9e42-12bd5a6be176.jpg', E'/reagents/96-well-tissue-culture-treated-cell-culture-plate-sterile', E'category-1780539818236', E'Cell Culture Plate', E'product', NULL, 1780979981743, '2026-06-08T23:39:41.743000+00:00', E'BA076096', E'In Stock', E'$170', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• TC-Treated Surface', E'• Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction', E'• Flat-Bottom Well Design', E'• Thin-Walled Wells for Enhanced Thermal Consistency', E'• Protective Lid Included', E'• Excellent Optical Clarity', E'• Gamma Irradiated Sterility', E'• Non-Pyrogenic, DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Human DNA-Free', E'• Individually Packaged for Sterility and Convenience', E'• Suitable for Cell Culture and Cell-Based Assays']::text[], ARRAY[E'100Pcs/Package']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Adherent Cell Culture\n\n• Cell-Based Assays\n\n• Drug Discovery and Compound Screening\n\n• Microscopy and Cell Imaging\n\n• Gene Expression Studies\n\n• Stem Cell and Primary Cell Culture\n\n• Biotechnology and Pharmaceutical Research\n\n• High-Throughput Screening', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/1774be7f-069c-411f-9e42-12bd5a6be176.jpg', E'/media/product_images/5237b2ac-1ef3-4630-9ce6-d5439abe2a49.jpg', E'/media/product_images/902b9346-b003-4282-a639-34603593c1e9.jpg', E'/media/product_images/c6aa13b1-03f7-4f89-b75b-d322c083b360.jpg', E'/media/product_images/6a49528c-4915-4510-9c4e-32570ee20e52.jpg']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780979981743", "link": "/reagents/96-well-tissue-culture-treated-cell-culture-plate-sterile", "name": "96-Well Tissue Culture-Treated Cell Culture Plate, Sterile", "category": "category-1780539818236", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1780979981743, "groupName": "Cell Culture Plate", "description": "BioArk Multiwell Cell Culture Plates are manufactured from premium virgin polystyrene (PS) and feature a tissue culture (TC)-treated surface to promote consistent cell attachment, growth, and proliferation. Designed with flat-bottom wells and supplied with a matching lid, these plates provide an ideal environment for routine cell culture, drug screening, cell-based assays, and other life science research applications.\\n\\nThe precision-engineered plate design helps minimize the impact of external environmental factors while maintaining optimal culture conditions. Thin-walled well bottoms improve thermal consistency across the plate, reducing edge effects and supporting more uniform experimental results. The optically clear flat-bottom wells provide excellent visibility for microscopic observation, imaging, and sample analysis.\\n\\nEach plate is gamma irradiated and certified non-pyrogenic, DNase-free, RNase-free, and human DNA-free to ensure the highest level of purity for sensitive cell culture and biological research workflows. Manufactured under strict quality standards, BioArk Multiwell Culture Plates offer reliable performance, excellent optical clarity, and consistent results for academic, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical research laboratories."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/1774be7f-069c-411f-9e42-12bd5a6be176.jpg", "/media/product_images/5237b2ac-1ef3-4630-9ce6-d5439abe2a49.jpg", "/media/product_images/902b9346-b003-4282-a639-34603593c1e9.jpg", "/media/product_images/c6aa13b1-03f7-4f89-b75b-d322c083b360.jpg", "/media/product_images/6a49528c-4915-4510-9c4e-32570ee20e52.jpg"], "manuals": [], "options": ["100Pcs/Package"], "createdAt": 1780979981743, "listPrice": "$170", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": [], "keyFeatures": ["\\u2022 TC-Treated Surface", "\\u2022 Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction", "\\u2022 Flat-Bottom Well Design", "\\u2022 Thin-Walled Wells for Enhanced Thermal Consistency", "\\u2022 Protective Lid Included", "\\u2022 Excellent Optical Clarity", "\\u2022 Gamma Irradiated Sterility", "\\u2022 Non-Pyrogenic, DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Human DNA-Free", "\\u2022 Individually Packaged for Sterility and Convenience", "\\u2022 Suitable for Cell Culture and Cell-Based Assays"], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {}, "catalogNumber": "BA076096", "performanceData": "\\u2022 Adherent Cell Culture\\n\\n\\u2022 Cell-Based Assays\\n\\n\\u2022 Drug Discovery and Compound Screening\\n\\n\\u2022 Microscopy and Cell Imaging\\n\\n\\u2022 Gene Expression Studies\\n\\n\\u2022 Stem Cell and Primary Cell Culture\\n\\n\\u2022 Biotechnology and Pharmaceutical Research\\n\\n\\u2022 High-Throughput Screening", "storageSt