    (38, E'custom-1780976114258', E'1000 μL Universal Pipette Tips –Non-Filtered', E'1000 μL Universal Pipette Tips – Non-Filtered

Our 1000 μL Universal Pipette Tips are manufactured from high-quality polypropylene (PP) to provide reliable performance, precision liquid handling, and consistent results for a wide range of laboratory workflows. Designed for both single-channel and multi-channel pipettes, these tips offer broad compatibility with most major pipette brands, including Eppendorf, Gilson, Thermo Fisher, Sartorius, Biohit, Oxford, DLAB, and other standard pipette systems.

Featuring low-retention surface technology, these tips help minimize sample loss by reducing liquid adhesion to the tip surface, resulting in improved sample recovery and enhanced pipetting accuracy. The high-quality manufacturing process ensures a secure pipette fit, consistent dispensing performance, and dependable operation for routine laboratory applications.

As one of the most commonly used pipette tip formats in research, academic, clinical, and industrial laboratories, these universal non-filtered tips provide a cost-effective solution for everyday liquid handling tasks while maintaining high standards of quality and performance. Please note that Rainin pipettes require specially designed tips and are not compatible with standard universal pipette tips. Users of less common pipette brands are encouraged to verify compatibility prior to purchase.', E'/media/product_images/feec2df1-454d-47fe-816a-8fe19dff5984.jpg', E'/reagents/1000-l-universal-pipette-tips-non-filtered', E'category-1780539818236', E'Pipette Tips', E'product', NULL, 1780976114258, '2026-06-08T22:35:14.258000+00:00', E'BA860040', E'In Stock', E'$286', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Low-Retention Surface for Enhanced Sample Recovery and Pipetting Accuracy', E'• Integrated Aerosol Barrier Filter Helps Prevent Cross-Contamination and Liquid Backflow', E'• Universal Compatibility with Most Major Single- and Multi-Channel Pipettes', E'• Manufactured in a Class 100,000 Cleanroom Environment', E'• Certified DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Non-Pyrogenic', E'• Sterile and Ready-to-Use for Sensitive Laboratory Applications', E'• CE Marked and ISO 13485:2016 Certified', E'• Compliant with IVDD 98/79/EC Requirements', E'• Consistent Quality and Reliable Performance for Routine and Precision Liquid Handling', E'• Ideal for PCR, qPCR, Molecular Biology, Cell Culture, and Diagnostic Workflows']::text[], ARRAY[E'10 Racks/Box; 5 Boxes/Case']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Accurate Liquid Transfer and Precision Pipetting

• Reagent, Buffer, and Sample Preparation

