• High-Throughput Screening and Automated Liquid Handling

• Routine Research, Clinical, and Analytical Laboratory Operations', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/feec2df1-454d-47fe-816a-8fe19dff5984.jpg', E'/media/product_images/d95e92d2-bc96-4a94-83e4-33505d5af098.webp', E'/media/product_images/6181e58b-2538-4c05-97d5-068d1b6920f0.webp', E'/media/product_images/1b5433e4-d9ca-4fda-8c8c-7cd485de63d2.webp', E'/media/product_images/06798b99-2925-4234-ab1b-f899b5415e69.jpg']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780976114258", "link": "/reagents/1000-l-universal-pipette-tips-non-filtered", "name": "1000 \u03bcL Universal Pipette Tips \u2013Non-Filtered", "category": "category-1780539818236", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1780976114258, "groupName": "Pipette Tips", "description": "1000 \u03bcL Universal Pipette Tips \u2013 Non-Filtered\n\nOur 1000 \u03bcL Universal Pipette Tips are manufactured from high-quality polypropylene (PP) to provide reliable performance, precision liquid handling, and consistent results for a wide range of laboratory workflows. Designed for both single-channel and multi-channel pipettes, these tips offer broad compatibility with most major pipette brands, including Eppendorf, Gilson, Thermo Fisher, Sartorius, Biohit, Oxford, DLAB, and other standard pipette systems.\n\nFeaturing low-retention surface technology, these tips help minimize sample loss by reducing liquid adhesion to the tip surface, resulting in improved sample recovery and enhanced pipetting accuracy. The high-quality manufacturing process ensures a secure pipette fit, consistent dispensing performance, and dependable operation for routine laboratory applications.\n\nAs one of the most commonly used pipette tip formats in research, academic, clinical, and industrial laboratories, these universal non-filtered tips provide a cost-effective solution for everyday liquid handling tasks while maintaining high standards of quality and performance. Please note that Rainin pipettes require specially designed tips and are not compatible with standard universal pipette tips. Users of less common pipette brands are encouraged to verify compatibility prior to purchase."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/feec2df1-454d-47fe-816a-8fe19dff5984.jpg", "/media/product_images/d95e92d2-bc96-4a94-83e4-33505d5af098.webp", "/media/product_images/6181e58b-2538-4c05-97d5-068d1b6920f0.webp", "/media/product_images/1b5433e4-d9ca-4fda-8c8c-7cd485de63d2.webp", "/media/product_images/06798b99-2925-4234-ab1b-f899b5415e69.jpg"], "manuals": [], "options": ["10 Racks/Box; 5 Boxes/Case"], "createdAt": 1780976114258, "listPrice": "$286", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": [], "keyFeatures": ["\u2022 Low-Retention Surface for Enhanced Sample Recovery and Pipetting Accuracy", "\u2022 Integrated Aerosol Barrier Filter Helps Prevent Cross-Contamination and Liquid Backflow", "\u2022 Universal Compatibility with Most Major Single- and Multi-Channel Pipettes", "\u2022 Manufactured in a Class 100,000 Cleanroom Environment", "\u2022 Certified DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Non-Pyrogenic", "\u2022 Sterile and Ready-to-Use for Sensitive Laboratory Applications", "\u2022 CE Marked and ISO 13485:2016 Certified", "\u2022 Compliant with IVDD 98/79/EC Requirements", "\u2022 Consistent Quality and Reliable Performance for Routine and Precision Liquid Handling", "\u2022 Ideal for PCR, qPCR, Molecular Biology, Cell Culture, and Diagnostic Workflows"], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {}, "catalogNumber": "BA860040", "performanceData": "\u2022 Accurate Liquid Transfer and Precision Pipetting\n\n\u2022 Reagent, Buffer, and Sample Preparation\n\n\u2022 PCR, qPCR, and Nucleic Acid Workflows\n\n\u2022 Sample Dispensing into Microplates, PCR Plates, and Reaction Tubes\n\n\u2022 Cell Culture and Microbiology Applications\n\n\u2022 Electrophoresis Gel Loading\n\n\u2022 ELISA and Diagnostic Assays\n\n\u2022 Supernatant Transfer and Phase Separation Procedures\n\n\u2022 High-Throughput Screening and Automated Liquid Handling\n\n\u2022 Routine Research, Clinical, and Analytical Laboratory Operations", "storageStability": "", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (39, E'custom-1780979031207', E'96-Well qPCR Plate, Semi-skirted, 0.2 mL', E'BioArk 96-Well qPCR Plates, Semi-Skirted, 0.2 mL are designed for reliable performance in real-time PCR, PCR amplification, and high-throughput molecular biology workflows. Manufactured from premium medical-grade polypropylene, these plates provide excellent thermal conductivity and uniform heat transfer across all wells, helping to ensure accurate, reproducible amplification results and consistent assay performance.

The semi-skirted design offers an ideal balance of rigidity and compatibility, providing improved plate handling, labeling convenience, and compatibility with a wide range of thermal cyclers and automated laboratory systems. Precision-molded wells with uniform wall thickness support efficient thermal cycling and reliable sample processing, while secure sealing with adhesive films or cap strips helps minimize sample evaporation and cross-contamination.

Produced under stringent quality control standards, BioArk 96-well qPCR plates are suitable for gene expression analysis, genotyping, molecular diagnostics, pathogen detection, next-generation sequencing workflows, and other life science research applications. Their robust construction, excellent thermal performance, and broad instrument compatibility make them a dependable choice for research, clinical, and biotechnology laboratories.', E'/media/product_images/be750c48-4a70-49ee-8a08-197239a7650f.jpg', E'/reagents/96-well-qpcr-plate-semi-skirted-0-2-ml', E'category-1780539818236', E'PCR Consumables', E'product', NULL, 1780979031207, '2026-06-08T23:23:51.207000+00:00', E'BA802016', E'In Stock', E'$178', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Premium Medical-Grade Polypropylene – Manufactured from high-quality imported polypropylene (PP) to ensure excellent purity, durability, and thermal performance.', E'• Precision-Molded Construction – Produced using advanced injection molding technology and proprietary mold designs for consistent quality and dimensional accuracy.', E'• Uniform Thin-Wall Design – Optimized wall thickness promotes rapid, even heat transfer, supporting efficient thermal cycling and reproducible PCR/qPCR results.', E'• High Manufacturing Standards – Produced in an ISO Class 8 cleanroom environment to minimize particulate contamination and ensure product consistency.', E'• Certified Contaminant-Free – Tested and certified DNA-free, DNase-free, RNase-free, and Pyrogen/Endotoxin-free for sensitive molecular biology and diagnostic applications.', E'• Reliable Assay Performance – Designed to support accurate amplification, fluorescence detection, and high-throughput laboratory workflows.', E'• Broad Instrument Compatibility – Compatible with most standard PCR and real-time qPCR thermal cyclers.']::text[], ARRAY[E'5 Packs/Case (100 Plates)']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• PCR and qPCR Workflows – Designed for reliable DNA amplification, quantitative PCR (qPCR), and real-time PCR applications.

• Gene Expression Analysis – Ideal for gene expression profiling, transcript quantification, and biomarker research.

