technology, pharmaceutical, and clinical research laboratories."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/06d3d137-43cf-4e5b-b645-36b56cc6b564.png", "/media/product_images/76f68401-d6c3-49c1-ac26-81e8e4d9fc01.png", "/media/product_images/311dfd38-adc7-400d-8e74-c324fc629ea9.png", "/media/product_images/c8339324-e175-4eeb-ae1e-eaad231429a1.jpg", "/media/product_images/cc9b3e0a-5f0f-4de8-b98b-a11d40b3734c.jpg"], "manuals": [], "options": ["100Pcs/Package"], "createdAt": 1780979765772, "listPrice": "$170", "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "isFeatured": false, "manualUrls": [], "keyFeatures": ["\u2022 TC-Treated Surface", "\u2022 Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction", "\u2022 Flat-Bottom Well Design", "\u2022 Thin-Walled Wells for Enhanced Thermal Consistency", "\u2022 Protective Lid Included", "\u2022 Excellent Optical Clarity", "\u2022 Gamma Irradiated Sterility", "\u2022 Non-Pyrogenic, DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Human DNA-Free", "\u2022 Individually Packaged for Sterility and Convenience", "\u2022 Suitable for Cell Culture and Cell-Based Assays"], "availability": "In Stock", "optionPrices": {}, "catalogNumber": "BA076012", "performanceData": "\u2022 Adherent Cell Culture\n\n\u2022 Cell-Based Assays\n\n\u2022 Drug Discovery and Compound Screening\n\n\u2022 Microscopy and Cell Imaging\n\n\u2022 Gene Expression Studies\n\n\u2022 Stem Cell and Primary Cell Culture\n\n\u2022 Biotechnology and Pharmaceutical Research\n\n\u2022 High-Throughput Screening", "storageStability": "", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (43, E'custom-1780978422114', E'2.0 mL DNase/RNase-Free Microcentrifuge Tube', E'SnapLock MicroCentrifuge Tubes are designed for secure sample storage, processing, and centrifugation in molecular biology, cell biology, clinical, and research laboratories. Manufactured from high-quality polypropylene, these tubes provide excellent durability, chemical resistance, and reliable performance for a wide range of laboratory applications. The snap-lock cap design creates a secure seal to help prevent sample leakage, evaporation, and contamination during handling, storage, and centrifugation.

For convenient sample identification, each tube features a frosted cap surface and a large frosted writing panel on the side, allowing clear labeling and traceability. The cap incorporates a thin central membrane that enables easy sample access using a syringe needle without opening the tube, helping maintain sample integrity and reduce contamination risk.

Engineered to withstand centrifugation forces up to 14,000 × g, SnapLock Micro Centrifuge Tubes are suitable for routine sample preparation, storage, and separation workflows. Certified RNase-free, DNase-free, and non-pyrogenic, these tubes provide the purity and reliability required for sensitive molecular biology and life science applications.', E'/media/product_images/a44edbbc-057e-4476-aa93-bc9ba416f856.webp', E'/reagents/2-0-ml-dnase-rnase-free-microcentrifuge-tube', E'category-1780539818236', E'centrifuge Tubes', E'product', NULL, 1780978422114, '2026-06-08T23:13:42.114000+00:00', E'BA801182', E'In Stock', E'$351', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Secure Snap-Lock Cap – Provides a reliable seal to minimize sample leakage, evaporation, and contamination.', E'• High Centrifugation Performance – Withstands forces up to 14,000 × g for routine laboratory applications.', E'• Easy Sample Identification – Frosted cap and side writing panel allow convenient labeling and tracking.', E'• Needle-Accessible Cap – Thin membrane in the cap enables sample access by syringe without opening the tube.', E'• High-Quality Polypropylene – Durable, chemically resistant, and suitable for a wide range of laboratory procedures.', E'• RNase-/DNase-Free – Ideal for sensitive DNA, RNA, and molecular biology applications.', E'• Non-Pyrogenic – Manufactured to support sample integrity and reduce contamination risks.', E'• Single-Piece Design – Integrated tube and cap for convenient handling and secure sample storage.']::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Sample Centrifugation and Separation – Ideal for the separation, sedimentation, and collection of cells, nucleic acids, proteins, and other biological materials during centrifugation procedures.

• PCR and Molecular Biology Workflows – Suitable for PCR, qPCR, DNA/RNA extraction, enzymatic reactions, and other molecular biology applications.

• Sample Storage and Preservation – Used for the short- and long-term storage of biological samples, reagents, enzymes, and nucleic acids.

• Chemical and Reagent Preparation – Convenient for mixing, diluting, and storing small volumes of laboratory reagents and chemical solutions.

• Protein Research Applications – Supports protein precipitation, purification, separation, and sample preparation workflows.

• High-Speed Centrifugation Procedures – Designed for applications requiring high centrifugal forces, including organelle isolation and macromolecule separation.

• Cell Biology and Microbiology Studies – Suitable for handling cell suspensions, microbial cultures, and other biological samples.

• Routine Laboratory Operations – Ideal for sample collection, aliquoting, transport, mixing, and general laboratory processing tasks.

• Clinical, Academic, and Research Laboratories – Widely used in life science research, biotechnology, diagnostics, pharmaceutical development, and quality control laboratories.', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/a44edbbc-057e-4476-aa93-bc9ba416f856.webp', E'/media/product_images/0142d872-c218-4a49-88c3-0eab3dba08f0.webp']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780978422114", "link": "/reagents/2-0-ml-dnase-rnase-free-microcentrifuge-tube", "name": "2.0 mL DNase/RNase-Free Microcentrifuge Tube", "category": "category-1780539818236", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1780978422114, "groupName": "centrifuge Tubes", "description": "SnapLock MicroCentrifuge Tubes are designed for secure sample storage, processing, and centrifugation in molecular biology, cell biology, clinical, and research laboratories. Manufactured from high-quality polypropylene, these tubes provide excellent durability, chemical resistance, and reliable performance for a wide range of laboratory applications. The snap-lock cap design creates a secure seal to help prevent sample leakage, evaporation, and contamination during handling, storage, and centrifugation.\n\nFor convenient sample identification, each tube features a frosted cap surface and a large frosted writing panel on the side, allowing clear labeling and traceability. The cap incorporates a thin central membrane that enables easy sample access using a syringe needle without opening the tube, helping maintain sample integrity and reduce contamination risk.\n\nEngineered to withstand centrifugation forces up to 14,000 \u00d7 g, SnapLock Micro Centrifuge Tubes are suitable for routine sample preparation, storage, and separation workflows. Certified RNase-free, DNase-free, and non-pyrogenic, these tubes provide the purity and reliability required for sensitive molecular biology and life science applications."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/a44edbbc-057