    (45, E'custom-1780980230161', E'T75 Tissue Culture Flask, Treated Surface, Sterile', E'BioArk Cell Culture Flasks are designed to provide a reliable and efficient environment for the cultivation, expansion, and maintenance of adherent cells. Manufactured from high-quality polystyrene with a tissue culture-treated surface, these flasks offer excellent cell attachment and growth while maximizing available culture area through their optimized flat growth surface.

The ergonomic angled neck design provides easy access for pipettes and cell scrapers, simplifying media exchange and cell handling procedures. Vented caps equipped with a 0.2 μm hydrophobic filter promote efficient gas exchange while helping to protect cultures from microbial contamination, ensuring optimal conditions for cell growth. Large writing areas on each flask allow convenient sample identification and experimental tracking.

Produced under stringent quality standards, BioArk Cell Culture Flasks deliver consistent performance and dependable results for routine cell culture applications. Available in T25, T75, and T175 growth areas, these flasks accommodate a wide range of research, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical laboratory workflows.', E'/media/product_images/038174c7-1024-43da-bc3a-9546253896c9.jpg', E'/reagents/t75-tissue-culture-flask-treated-surface-sterile', E'category-1780539818236', E'Cell Culture Flasks', E'product', NULL, 1780980230161, '2026-06-08T23:43:50.161000+00:00', E'BA803075', E'In Stock', E'$174', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• TC-Treated Surface for Enhanced Cell Attachment and Growth', E'• Vented Cap with 0.2 μm Filter for Efficient Gas Exchange and Contamination Protection', E'• Ergonomic Angled Neck for Easy Access with Pipettes and Cell Scrapers', E'• Dual-Sided Graduations and Writing Areas for Convenient Volume Monitoring and Sample Identification', E'• Individually Packaged in Sterile, Self-Sealing Bags to Maintain Product Integrity', E'• Stackable Design for Efficient Storage and Handling', E'• Gamma Sterilized and Ready-to-Use', E'• Certified DNase-Free and RNase-Free for Sensitive Cell Culture Applications', E'• High-Clarity Polystyrene Construction for Easy Visual Inspection of Cell Cultures', E'• Available in Multiple Growth Areas to Support Diverse Cell Culture Requirements']::text[], ARRAY[E'18 Bags/Case (90Pcs/Case)']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Supports the culture and expansion of adherent cell lines by providing a tissue culture-treated surface that promotes strong and consistent cell attachment.

• Ideal for long-term cell maintenance and routine cell propagation in research, biotechnology, and pharmaceutical laboratories.

• Enables efficient large-scale cell expansion for downstream applications such as protein expression, cell banking, and assay development.

• Suitable for a wide range of mammalian cell culture workflows, including transfection, gene expression studies, and cell-based assays.

• Provides a reliable platform for drug discovery, toxicity testing, and other cell biology research applications requiring reproducible cell growth.', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/038174c7-1024-43da-bc3a-9546253896c9.jpg', E'/media/product_images/95f161e5-c6f7-4dc6-9194-e40aaa34651c.jpg', E'/media/product_images/16915808-af89-4a36-b583-8759693f68e7.webp', E'/media/product_images/42f26e41-1d5e-44c8-9ae0-8278fd75d394.webp']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780980230161", "link": "/reagents/t75-tissue-culture-flask-treated-surface-sterile", "name": "T75 Tissue Culture Flask, Treated Surface, Sterile", "category": "category-1780539818236", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1780980230161, "groupName": "Cell Culture Flasks", "description": "BioArk Cell Culture Flasks are designed to provide a reliable and efficient environment for the cultivation, expansion, and maintenance of adherent cells. Manufactured from high-quality polystyrene with a tissue culture-treated surface, these flasks offer excellent cell attachment and growth while maximizing available culture area through their optimized flat growth surface.\n\nThe ergonomic angled neck design provides easy access for pipettes and cell scrapers, simplifying media exchange and cell handling procedures. Vented caps equipped with a 0.2 \u03bcm hydrophobic filter promote efficient gas exchange while helping to protect cultures from microbial contamination, ensuring optimal conditions for cell growth. Large writing areas on each flask allow convenient sample identification and experimental tracking.\n\nProduced under stringent quality standards, BioArk Cell Culture Flasks deliver consistent performance and dependable results for routine cell culture applications. Available in T25, T75, and T175 growth areas, these flasks accommodate a wide range of research, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical laboratory workflows."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"i