    (50, E'custom-1780975837520', E'200 μL Universal Pipette Tips – Filtered – Low Retention', E'Filtered Low-Retention Universal Pipette Tips

Our Filtered Low-Retention Universal Pipette Tips are manufactured from high-quality polypropylene (PP) to provide reliable performance, precision liquid handling, and enhanced sample protection for a wide range of laboratory workflows. Designed for both single-channel and multi-channel pipettes, these tips offer broad compatibility with most major pipette brands, including Eppendorf, Gilson, Thermo Fisher, Sartorius, Biohit, Oxford, DLAB, and other standard pipette systems.

Featuring an integrated aerosol barrier filter and low-retention surface technology, these tips help minimize the risk of cross-contamination, liquid backflow, and pipette contamination while maximizing sample recovery. The low-retention design reduces liquid adhesion, improving pipetting accuracy and consistency, particularly when working with valuable or low-volume samples.

As one of the most widely used pipette tip formats in research, clinical, and diagnostic laboratories, these universal filtered tips provide a cost-effective solution for routine liquid handling applications while maintaining high standards of quality and performance. Please note that Rainin pipettes require specially designed tips and are not compatible with standard universal pipette tips. Users of less common pipette brands are encouraged to verify compatibility prior to purchase.', E'/media/product_images/a2e7555f-0f9d-4d76-a670-9d6f5747ff56.webp', E'/reagents/200-l-universal-pipette-tips-filtered-low-retention', E'category-1780539818236', E'Pipette Tips', E'product', NULL, 1780975837520, '2026-06-08T22:30:37.520000+00:00', E'BA800609', E'In Stock', E'$250', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Low-Retention Surface for Enhanced Sample Recovery and Pipetting Accuracy', E'• Integrated Aerosol Barrier Filter Helps Prevent Cross-Contamination and Liquid Backflow', E'• Universal Compatibility with Most Major Single- and Multi-Channel Pipettes', E'• Manufactured in a Class 100,000 Cleanroom Environment', E'• Certified DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Non-Pyrogenic', E'• Sterile and Ready-to-Use for Sensitive Laboratory Applications', E'• CE Marked and ISO 13485:2016 Certified', E'• Compliant with IVDD 98/79/EC Requirements', E'• Consistent Quality and Reliable Performance for Routine and Precision Liquid Handling', E'• Ideal for PCR, qPCR, Molecular Biology, Cell Culture, and Diagnostic Workflows']::text[], ARRAY[E'10 Racks/Box; 5 Boxes/Case (4800Tips/Case)']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Accurate Liquid Transfer and Precision Pipetting

• Reagent, Buffer, and Sample Preparation

• PCR, qPCR, and Nucleic Acid Workflows

• Sample Dispensing into Microplates, PCR Plates, and Reaction Tubes

• Cell Culture and Microbiology Applications

• Electrophoresis Gel Loading

• ELISA and Diagnostic Assays

• Supernatant Transfer and Phase Separation Procedures

• High-Throughput Screening and Automated Liquid Handling

