    (54, E'custom-1780979358256', E'Sterile Cell Spreaders (Individually or Bulk Packaged)', E'BioArk Sterile Cell Spreaders are designed for the uniform spreading of bacterial, yeast, and other microbial cultures across agar surfaces, ensuring consistent colony distribution and reliable experimental results. Manufactured from high-quality, smooth-finished plastic, these disposable spreaders provide gentle and even sample distribution without damaging the agar surface.

The ergonomic design enables comfortable handling and precise control, making them ideal for routine microbiology, environmental testing, food safety, clinical diagnostics, and life science research applications. The smooth spreading surface helps achieve uniform cell distribution, improving colony isolation and reproducibility across culture plates.

Available in both individually wrapped sterile packaging and bulk-packaged sterile formats, BioArk Cell Spreaders offer flexibility to meet the needs of different laboratory workflows. Sterilized and ready to use, they eliminate the need for flaming or re-sterilization, reducing contamination risks and improving laboratory efficiency.', E'/media/product_images/f18620da-c319-4532-ab99-294b1bffdb50.webp', E'/reagents/sterile-cell-spreaders-individually-or-bulk-packaged', E'category-1780539818236', E'Bacterial Culture plate', E'product', NULL, 1780979358256, '2026-06-08T23:29:18.256000+00:00', E'BA651001', E'In Stock', E'$56', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Ideal for Uniform Spreading of Bacterial, Yeast, and Microbial Cultures', E'• Smooth, Polished Spreading Surface Minimizes Agar Damage During Use', E'• Slightly Angled Design Enhances Control and Promotes Even Sample Distribution', E'• L-Shaped Configuration Enables Complete Coverage of Petri Dish and Agar Plate Surfaces', E'• Disposable Design Eliminates the Need for Flaming or Re-Sterilization', E'• Gamma Irradiated and Sterile for Immediate Use', E'• Helps Reduce Cross-Contamination Risks in Microbiological Workflows', E'• Lightweight and Ergonomic for Comfortable Handling', E'• Available in Individually Wrapped or Bulk-Packaged Sterile Formats', E'• Suitable for Routine Microbiology, Environmental Testing, Clinical, and Research Applications']::text[], ARRAY[E'500 Pcs/Case']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Facilitates the uniform spreading of bacterial, yeast, and fungal cultures on agar plates for colony isolation and enumeration.

