    (55, E'custom-1780980465967', E'35 mm Tissue Culture-Treated Cell Culture Dish, Sterile', E'BioArk 35 mm Cell Culture Dishes are manufactured from high-quality polystyrene and feature a tissue culture (TC)-treated surface to support optimal cell attachment, growth, and proliferation. Designed for routine cell culture applications, these dishes provide a reliable environment for cultivating a wide range of adherent cell types in research, biotechnology, and pharmaceutical laboratories.

The precision-engineered flat-bottom design creates a uniform growth surface, promoting even cell distribution and reducing variability caused by surface irregularities. This helps improve culture consistency, experimental reproducibility, and the accuracy of downstream analyses. The crystal-clear construction also allows excellent visibility for routine microscopic observation and cell monitoring.

Produced under strict quality standards, BioArk cell culture dishes provide dependable performance for cell maintenance, expansion, transfection studies, and other cell-based research applications.', E'/media/product_images/b567418c-a95b-43b8-ac84-fbe1e8e2b4d5.png', E'/reagents/35-mm-tissue-culture-treated-cell-culture-dish-sterile', E'category-1780539818236', E'Cell Culture Dishes', E'product', NULL, 1780980465967, '2026-06-08T23:47:45.967000+00:00', E'BA803035', E'In Stock', E'$123', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Enhanced Handling and Ergonomic Design', E'• Secure and Stable Stacking for Easy Storage and Transport', E'• TC-Treated Surface for Improved Cell Attachment and Growth', E'• Suitable for Both Adherent and Suspension Cell Culture', E'• Uniform Growth Surface for Consistent Cell Distribution', E'• Excellent Optical Clarity for Microscopic Observation', E'• Ideal for Cell-Based Assays and Biological Research', E'• Reliable Performance for Routine Cell Culture Applications', E'• Durable Polystyrene Construction', E'• Sterile and Ready-to-Use']::text[], ARRAY[E'25 Packs/Case(500 Pcs/Case)']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Supports the culture, expansion, and maintenance of adherent cells for routine research and laboratory applications.

• Provides a suitable environment for the growth and handling of suspension cells in biological and biomedical studies.

• Enables cell-based assays, including cell viability, proliferation, migration, and cytotoxicity studies.

• Facilitates microscopic observation, cell imaging, and morphological analysis through its optically clear design.

• Supports studies of cell signaling pathways, cellular responses, and cell-to-cell communication.

• Ideal for stem cell and primary cell culture applications requiring reliable cell attachment and growth conditions.

• Widely used in drug discovery, compound screening, and toxicity testing workflows.

• Serves as a versatile platform for biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and life science research applications.

• Promotes consistent and reproducible cell growth for downstream molecular and cellular analyses.', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/b567418c-a95b-43b8-ac84-fbe1e8e2b4d5.png', E'/media/product_images/18678a83-8740-47dc-ae41-186d98f483a2.png', E'/media/product_images/7fa634f7-8d7d-485f-b07f-4487f34d03a7.png', E'/media/product_images/c137b791-1bc8-4221-9dd8-7c0b31c30410.png']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780980465967", "link": "/reagents/35-mm-tissue-culture-treated-cell-culture-dish-sterile", "name": "35 mm Tissue Culture-Treated Cell Culture Dish, Sterile", "category": "category-1780539818236", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1780980465967, "groupName": "Cell Culture Dishes", "description": "BioArk 35 mm Cell Culture Dishes are manufactured from high-quality polystyrene and feature a tissue culture (TC)-treated surface to support optimal cell attachment, growth, and proliferation. Designed for routine cell culture applications, these dishes provide a reliable environment for cultivating a wide range of adherent cell types in research, biotechnology, and pharmaceutical laboratories.\n\nThe precision-engineered flat-bottom design creates a uniform growth surface, promoting even cell distribution and reducing variability caused by surface irregularities. This helps improve culture consistency, experimental reproducibility, and the accuracy of downstream analyses. The crystal-clear construction also allows excellent visibility for routine microscopic observation and cell monitoring.\n\nProduced under strict quality standards, BioArk cell culture dishes provide dependable performance for cell maintenance, expansion, transfection studies, and other cell-based research applications."}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/b567418c-a95b-43b8-ac84-fbe1e8e2b4d5.png", "/media/product_images/18678a83-8740-47dc-ae41-186d98f483a2.png", "/media/product_images/7fa634f7-8d7d-485f-b07f-448