 clinical specimens, reference materials, and diagnostic samples.\n\n\u2022 Freeze-Thaw and Sterilization Processes \u2013 Designed to withstand repeated freeze-thaw cycles and autoclaving at 121\u00b0C for routine laboratory workflows.\n\n\u2022 Research and Laboratory Sample Storage \u2013 Compatible with standard cryogenic storage systems, freezer boxes, and laboratory equipment for organized sample management.", "storageStability": "", "showInReagentSection": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896000+00:00'),
    (69, E'custom-1772227271829', E'Prestained Protein Marker 180KD (10-180KD)', E'• The Prestained Protein Marker 180 kDa contains 10 highly pure, pre-stained recombinant proteins spanning 10–180 kDa, providing a reliable molecular weight standard for SDS-PAGE and Western blotting. The ladder features distinct multi-color bands—a green 10 kDa band and a pink 70 kDa reference band, with remaining bands in blue—allowing easy band identification, real-time electrophoresis tracking, and efficient transfer assessment. <br>
• It offers performance equivalent to Thermo Scientific PageRuler™ Prestained Protein Ladder (Cat. 26617) at less than half the price, making it a cost-effective alternative for routine and high-throughput applications.', E'/media/product_images/6a1fc0e2-3144-4d49-84eb-a85a93f888c5.png', E'/reagents/prestained-protein-marker-180kd-10-180kd', E'category-1766675365489', E'', E'product', NULL, 1772227271829, '2026-02-27T16:21:11.829000+00:00', E'BAPM1125', E'In Stock', E'$60', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'(~10, ~15, ~25, ~35, ~40, ~55, ~70, ~100, ~130, ~180 kDa),']::text[], ARRAY[E'500μL', E'2 X 500μL', E'5 X 500μL']::text[], E'{"500\u03bcL": "$60", "2 X 500\u03bcL": "$110", "5 X 500\u03bcL": "$250"}'::jsonb, E'Ship with wet ice; Store at -20℃, valid for 12 months.', E'', E'', ARRAY[E'BAPM1125 Manual']::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/d398a177-34e1-429f-9db2-bb234d5e5823.pdf']::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/6a1fc0e2-3144-4d49-84eb-a85a93f888c5.png', E'/media/product_images/27298605-2589-46fb-ba61-b58c8457167b.png', E'/media/product_images/171beb19-76cb-40ed-9994-2d5fbf813a96.png']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1772227271829", "link": "/reagents/prestained-protein-marker-180kd-10-180kd", "name": "Prestained Protein Marker 180KD (10-180KD)", "category": "category-1766675365489", "imageUrl": "", "createdAt": 1772227271829, "description": "\u2022 The Prestained Protein Marker 180 kDa contains 10 highly pure, pre-stained recombinant proteins spanning 10\u2013180 kDa, providing a reliable molecular weight standard for SDS-PAGE and Western blotting. The ladder features distinct multi-color bands\u2014a green 10 kDa band and a pink 70 kDa reference band, with remaining bands in blue\u2014allowing easy band identification, real-time electrophoresis tracking, and efficient transfer assessment. <br>\n\u2022 It offers performance equivalent to Thermo Scientific PageRuler\u2122 Prestained Protein Ladder (Cat. 