separation.\\n\\n\\u2022 Cell Biology and Microbiology Studies \\u2013 Suitable for handling cell suspensions, microbial cultures, and other biological samples.\\n\\n\\u2022 Routine Laboratory Operations \\u2013 Ideal for sample collection, aliquoting, transport, mixing, and general laboratory processing tasks.\\n\\n\\u2022 Clinical, Academic, and Research Laboratories \\u2013 Widely used in life science research, biotechnology, diagnostics, pharmaceutical development, and quality control laboratories.", "manuals": [], "manualUrls": [], "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "showInReagentSection": false, "isFeatured": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z'),
