5e.png", "/media/product_images/1f42655b-a02e-45cb-bbc8-d964a0600a68.png", "/media/product_images/9119af69-c30d-447b-bf75-ddded54658d9.png"], "showInReagentSection": false, "isFeatured": true}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z'),
    (45, E'custom-1780980230161', E'T75 Tissue Culture Flask, Treated Surface, Sterile', E'BioArk Cell Culture Flasks are designed to provide a reliable and efficient environment for the cultivation, expansion, and maintenance of adherent cells. Manufactured from high-quality polystyrene with a tissue culture-treated surface, these flasks offer excellent cell attachment and growth while maximizing available culture area through their optimized flat growth surface.\n\nThe ergonomic angled neck design provides easy access for pipettes and cell scrapers, simplifying media exchange and cell handling procedures. Vented caps equipped with a 0.2 μm hydrophobic filter promote efficient gas exchange while helping to protect cultures from microbial contamination, ensuring optimal conditions for cell growth. Large writing areas on each flask allow convenient sample identification and experimental tracking.\n\nProduced under stringent quality standards, BioArk Cell Culture Flasks deliver consistent performance and dependable results for routine cell culture applications. Available in T25, T75, and T175 growth areas, these flasks accommodate a wide range of research, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical laboratory workflows.', E'/media/product_images/038174c7-1024-43da-bc3a-9546253896c9.jpg', E'/reagents/t75-tissue-culture-flask-treated-surface-sterile', E'category-1780539818236', E'Cell Culture Flasks', E'product', NULL, 1780980230161, E'2026-06-08T23:43:50.161000', E'BA803075', E'In Stock', E'$174', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• TC-Treated Surface for Enhanced Cell Attachment and Growth', E'• Vented Cap with 0.2 μm Filter for Efficient Gas Exchange and Contamination Protection', E'• Ergonomic Angled Neck for Easy Access with Pipettes and Cell Scrapers', E'• Dual-Sided Graduations and Writing Areas for Convenient Volume Monitoring and Sample Identification', E'• Individually Packaged in Sterile, Self-Sealing Bags to Maintain Product Integrity', E'• Stackable Design for Efficient Storage and Handling', E'• Gamma Sterilized and Ready-to-Use', E'• Certified DNase-Free and RNase-Free for Sensitive Cell Culture Applications', E'• High-Clarity Polystyrene Construction for Easy Visual Inspection of Cell Cultures', E'• Available in Multiple Growth Areas to Support Diverse Cell Culture Requirements']::text[], ARRAY[E'18 Bags/Case (90Pcs/Case)']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Supports the culture and expansion of adherent cell lines by providing a tissue culture-treated surface that promotes strong and consistent cell attachment.\n\n• Ideal for long-term cell maintenance and routine cell propagation in research, biotechnology, and pharmaceutical laboratories.\n\n• Enables efficient large-scale cell expansion for downstream applications such as protein expression, cell banking, and assay development.\n\n• Suitable for a wide range of mammalian cell culture workflows, including transfection, gene expression studies, and cell-based assays.\n\n• Provides a reliable platform for drug discovery, toxicity testing, and other cell biology research applications requiring reproducible cell growth.', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/038174c7-1024-43da-bc3a-9546253896c9.jpg', E'/media/product_images/95f161e5-c6f7-4dc6-9194-e40aaa34651c.jpg', E'/media/product_images/16915808-af89-4a36-b583-8759693f68e7.webp', E'/media/product_images/42f26e41-1d5e-44c8-9ae0-8278fd75d394.webp']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780980230161", "name": "T75 Tissue Culture Flask, Treated Surface, Sterile", "description": "BioArk Cell Culture Flasks are designed to provide a reliable and efficient environment for the cultivation, expansion, and maintenance of adherent cells. Manufactured from high-quality polystyrene with a tissue culture-treated surface, these flasks offer excellent cell attachment and growth while maximizing available culture area through their optimized flat growth surface.\\n\\nThe ergonomic angled neck design provides easy access for pipettes and cell scrapers, simplifying media exchange and cell handling procedures. Vented caps equipped with a 0.2 \\u03bcm hydrophobic filter promote efficient gas exchange while helping to protect cultures from microbial contamination, ensuring optimal conditions for cell growth. Large writing areas on each flask allow convenient sample identification and experimental tracking.\\n\\nProduced under stringent quality standards, BioArk Cell Culture Flasks deliver consistent performance and dependable results for routine cell culture applications. Available in T25, T75, and T175 growth areas, these flasks accommodate a wide range of research, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical laboratory workflows.", "imageUrl": "", "link": "/reagents/t75-tissue-culture-flask-treated-surface-sterile", "category": "category-1780539818236", "createdAt": 1780980230161, "groupName": "Cell Culture Flasks"}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/038174c7-1024-43da-bc3a-9546253896c9.jpg", "/media/product_images/95f161e5-c6f7-4dc6-9194-e40aaa34651c.jpg", "/media/product_images/16915808-af89-4a36-b583-8759693f68e7.webp", "/media/product_images/42f26e41-1d5e-44c8-9ae0-8278fd75d394.webp"], "createdAt": 1780980230161, "catalogNumber": "BA803075", "availability": "In Stock", "listPrice": "$174", "options": ["18 Bags/Case (90Pcs/Case)"], "optionPrices": {}, "keyFeatures": ["\\u2022 TC-Treated Surface for Enhanced Cell Attachment and Growth", "\\u2022 Vented Cap with 0.2 \\u03bcm Filter for Efficient Gas Exchange and Contamination Protection", "\\u2022 Ergonomic Angled Neck for Easy Access with Pipettes and Cell Scrapers", "\\u2022 Dual-Sided Graduations and Writing Areas for Convenient Volume Monitoring and Sample Identification", "\\u2022 Individually Packaged in Sterile, Self-Sealing Bags to Maintain Product Integrity", "\\u2022 Stackable Design for Efficient Storage and Handling", "\\u2022 Gamma Sterilized and Ready-to-Use", "\\u2022 Certified DNase-Free and RNase-Free for Sensitive Cell Culture Applications", "\\u2022 High-Clarity Polystyrene Construction for Easy Visual Inspection of Cell Cultures", "\\u2022 Available in Multiple Growth Areas to Support Diverse Cell Culture Requirements"], "storageStability": "", "performanceData": "\\u2022 Supports the culture and expansion of adherent cell lines by providing a tissue culture-treated surface that promotes strong and consistent cell attachment.\\n\\n\\u2022 Ideal for long-term cell maintenance and routine cell propagation in research, biotechnology, and pharmaceutical laboratories.\\n\\n\\u2022 Enables efficient large-scale cell expansion for downstream applications such as protein expression, cell banking, and assay development.\\n\\n\\u2022 Suitable for a wide range of mammalian cell culture workflows, including transfection, gene expression studies, and cell-based assays.\\n\\n\\u2022 Provides a reliable platform for drug discovery, toxicity testing, and other cell biology research applications requiring reproducible cell growth.", "manuals": [], "manualUrls": [], "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "showInReagentSection": false, "isFeatured": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z'),
    (46, E'custom-1780712799171', E'Medium Nitrile Examination Gloves, Powder-Free', E'Zircon Touch® Exam Gloves are engineered to deliver exceptional protection, comfort, and tactile sensitivity for a wide range of professional applications. Designed for laboratory research, healthcare environments, food handling, and general-purpose use, these high-quality gloves provide a reliable barrier against contaminants while maintaining the dexterity required for precision tasks.\n\nManufactured to rigorous quality standards, Zircon Touch® Exam Gloves offer a comfortable fit, excellent flexibility, and dependable performance throughout extended use. Their durable construction helps reduce the risk of tears and punctures, while the textured surface enhances grip and control when handling instruments, samples, or equipment.\n\nCombining protection, comfort, and precision, Zircon Touch® Exam Gloves are an ideal choice for professionals who require reliable hand protection without compromising sensitivity or performance.', E'/media/product_images/a38f62d2-774d-41fd-885e-ef93a6d79cec.webp', E'/reagents/medium-nitrile-examination-gloves-powder-free-medium', E'category-1780539818236', E'Personal Protective Equipment (PPE)', E'product', NULL, 1780712799171, E'2026-06-05T21:26:39.171000', E'GN007-2-C', E'In Stock', E'65', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Exceptional Durability – Designed to withstand demanding laboratory, healthcare, and industrial applications while maintaining reliable protection.', E'• Micro-Textured Surface – Enhances grip and control when handling instruments, samples, and equipment, even in wet conditions.', E'• Strong and Flexible Construction – Combines excellent tensile strength with superior flexibility for enhanced comfort, dexterity, and tactile sensitivity.', E'• Precision Touch Sensitivity – Allows accurate handling of delicate tasks without compromising hand protection.', E'• Color-Coded Size Identification – Packaging is color coded by glove size for quick recognition, simplified inventory management, and improved workflow efficiency.', E'• Comfortable Fit for Extended Wear – Ergonomically designed to reduce hand fatigue during prolonged use.']::text[], ARRAY[E'1000 Pcs/Case']::text[], E'{"1000 Pcs/Case": "$65"}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Laboratory Research and Testing – Provides reliable hand protection and excellent tactile sensitivity for routine laboratory procedures and sample handling.\n\n• Healthcare and Clinical Environments – Suitable for examinations, patient care, and other applications requiring hygiene, comfort, and protection.\n\n• Food Processing and Food Handling – Helps maintain cleanliness and product safety while allowing precise handling of food products.\n\n• Pharmaceutical and Biotechnology Workflows – Ideal for manufacturing, quality control, and research applications where contamination control is essential.\n\n• Precision Handling Tasks – Excellent for applications requiring enhanced dexterity, tactile sensitivity, and accurate manipulation of small instruments or components.\n\n• General Industrial and Workplace Use – Offers a cost-effective solution for a wide range of protective applications requiring both durability and comfort.\n', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/a38f62d2-774d-41fd-885e-ef93a6d79cec.webp', E'/media/product_images/b01e07bb-dc2e-4d0d-a774-7066f1f0d139.webp', E'/media/product_images/b57d4325-8d73-4720-942e-a05cd7c217c6.webp']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780712799171", "name": "Medium Nitrile Examination Gloves, Powder-Free", "description": "Zircon Touch\\u00ae Exam Gloves are engineered to deliver exceptional protection, comfort, and tactile sensitivity for a wide range of professional applications. Designed for laboratory research, healthcare environments, food handling, and general-purpose use, these high-quality gloves provide a reliable barrier against contaminants while maintaining the dexterity required for precision tasks.\\n\\nManufactured to rigorous quality standards, Zircon Touch\\u00ae Exam Gloves offer a comfortable fit, excellent flexibility, and dependable performance throughout extended use. Their durable construction helps reduce the risk of tears and punctures, while the textured surface enhances grip and control when handling instruments, samples, or equipment.\\n\\nCombining protection, comfort, and precision, Zircon Touch\\u00ae Exam Gloves are an ideal choice for professionals who require reliable hand protection without compromising sensitivity or performance.", "imageUrl": "", "link": "/reagents/medium-nitrile-examination-gloves-powder-free-medium", "category": "category-1780539818236", "createdAt": 1780712799171, "groupName": "Personal Protective Equipment (PPE)"}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/a38f62d2-774d-41fd-885e-ef93a6d79cec.webp", "/media/product_images/b01e07bb-dc2e-4d0d-a774-7066f1f0d139.webp", "/media/product_images/b57d4325-8d73-4720-942e-a05cd7c217c6.webp"], "createdAt": 1780712799171, "catalogNumber": "GN007-2-C", "availability": "In Stock", "listPrice": "65", "options": ["1000 Pcs/Case"], "optionPrices": {"1000 Pcs/Case": "$65"}, "keyFeatures": ["\\u2022 Exceptional Durability \\u2013 Designed to withstand demanding laboratory, healthcare, and industrial applications while maintaining reliable protection.", "\\u2022 Micro-Textured Surface \\u2013 Enhances grip and control when handling instruments, samples, and equipment, even in wet conditions.", "\\u2022 Strong and Flexible Construction \\u2013 Combines excellent tensile strength with superior flexibility for enhanced comfort, dexterity, and tactile sensitivity.", "\\u2022 Precision Touch Sensitivity \\u2013 Allows accurate handling of delicate tasks without compromising hand protection.", "\\u2022 Color-Coded Size Identification \\u2013 Packaging is color coded by glove size for quick recognition, simplified inventory management, and improved workflow efficiency.", "\\u2022 Comfortable Fit for Extended Wear \\u2013 Ergonomically designed to reduce hand fatigue during prolonged use."], "storageStability": "", "performanceData": "\\u2022 Laboratory Research and Testing \\u2013 Provides reliable hand protection and excellent tactile sensitivity for routine laboratory procedures and sample handling.\\n\\n\\u2022 Healthcare and Clinical Environments \\u2013 Suitable for examinations, patient care, and other applications requiring hygiene, comfort, and protection.\\n\\n\\u2022 Food Processing and Food Handling \\u2013 Helps maintain cleanliness and product safety while allowing precise handling of food products.\\n\\n\\u2022 Pharmaceutical and Biotechnology Workflows \\u2013 Ideal for manufacturing, quality control, and research applications where contamination control is essential.\\n\\n\\u2022 Precision Handling Tasks \\u2013 Excellent for applications requiring enhanced dexterity, tactile sensitivity, and accurate manipulation of small instruments or components.\\n\\n\\u2022 General Industrial and Workplace Use \\u2013 Offers a cost-effective solution for a wide range of protective applications requiring both durability and comfort.\\n", "manuals": [], "manualUrls": [], "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "showInReagentSection": false, "isFeatured": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z'),
    (47, E'custom-1780979893063', E'24-Well Tissue Culture-Treated Cell Culture Plate, Sterile', E'"BioArk Multiwell Cell Culture Plates are manufactured from premium virgin polystyrene (PS) and feature a tissue culture (TC)-treated surface to promote consistent cell attachment, growth, and proliferation. Designed with flat-bottom wells and supplied with a matching lid, these plates provide an ideal environment for routine cell culture, drug screening, cell-based assays, and other life science research applications.\n\nThe precision-engineered plate design helps minimize the impact of external environmental factors while maintaining optimal culture conditions. Thin-walled well bottoms improve thermal consistency across the plate, reducing edge effects and supporting more uniform experimental results. The optically clear flat-bottom wells provide excellent visibility for microscopic observation, imaging, and sample analysis.\n\nEach plate is gamma irradiated and certified non-pyrogenic, DNase-free, RNase-free, and human DNA-free to ensure the highest level of purity for sensitive cell culture and biological research workflows. Manufactured under strict quality standards, BioArk Multiwell Culture Plates offer reliable performance, excellent optical clarity, and consistent results for academic, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical research laboratories."\n', E'/media/product_images/e6a2ceb0-afbf-4d6e-87a6-f5e89445dbcd.png', E'/reagents/24-well-tissue-culture-treated-cell-culture-plate-sterile', E'category-1780539818236', E'Cell Culture Plate', E'product', NULL, 1780979893063, E'2026-06-08T23:38:13.063000', E'BA076096', E'In Stock', E'$170', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• TC-Treated Surface', E'• Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction', E'• Flat-Bottom Well Design', E'• Thin-Walled Wells for Enhanced Thermal Consistency', E'• Protective Lid Included', E'• Excellent Optical Clarity', E'• Gamma Irradiated Sterility', E'• Non-Pyrogenic, DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Human DNA-Free', E'• Individually Packaged for Sterility and Convenience', E'• Suitable for Cell Culture and Cell-Based Assays']::text[], ARRAY[E'100Pcs/Package']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/e6a2ceb0-afbf-4d6e-87a6-f5e89445dbcd.png', E'/media/product_images/3ceb8eda-498c-4054-81b1-f77e7ba5c2e3.png', E'/media/product_images/3e73e832-8397-4150-a9b1-b147068c975e.jpg', E'/media/product_images/ce833981-c10e-49d1-ad84-5b432354ab97.jpg', E'/media/product_images/b540b3e8-1f42-44ae-8d51-a29af4814730.jpg']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780979893063", "name": "24-Well Tissue Culture-Treated Cell Culture Plate, Sterile", "description": "\\"BioArk Multiwell Cell Culture Plates are manufactured from premium virgin polystyrene (PS) and feature a tissue culture (TC)-treated surface to promote consistent cell attachment, growth, and proliferation. Designed with flat-bottom wells and supplied with a matching lid, these plates provide an ideal environment for routine cell culture, drug screening, cell-based assays, and other life science research applications.\\n\\nThe precision-engineered plate design helps minimize the impact of external environmental factors while maintaining optimal culture conditions. Thin-walled well bottoms improve thermal consistency across the plate, reducing edge effects and supporting more uniform experimental results. The optically clear flat-bottom wells provide excellent visibility for microscopic observation, imaging, and sample analysis.\\n\\nEach plate is gamma irradiated and certified non-pyrogenic, DNase-free, RNase-free, and human DNA-free to ensure the highest level of purity for sensitive cell culture and biological research workflows. Manufactured under strict quality standards, BioArk Multiwell Culture Plates offer reliable performance, excellent optical clarity, and consistent results for academic, biotechnology, pharmaceutical, and clinical research laboratories.\\"\\n", "imageUrl": "", "link": "/reagents/24-well-tissue-culture-treated-cell-culture-plate-sterile", "category": "category-1780539818236", "createdAt": 1780979893063, "groupName": "Cell Culture Plate"}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/e6a2ceb0-afbf-4d6e-87a6-f5e89445dbcd.png", "/media/product_images/3ceb8eda-498c-4054-81b1-f77e7ba5c2e3.png", "/media/product_images/3e73e832-8397-4150-a9b1-b147068c975e.jpg", "/media/product_images/ce833981-c10e-49d1-ad84-5b432354ab97.jpg", "/media/product_images/b540b3e8-1f42-44ae-8d51-a29af4814730.jpg"], "createdAt": 1780979893063, "catalogNumber": "BA076096", "availability": "In Stock", "listPrice": "$170", "options": ["100Pcs/Package"], "optionPrices": {}, "keyFeatures": ["\\u2022 TC-Treated Surface", "\\u2022 Premium Virgin Polystyrene Construction", "\\u2022 Flat-Bottom Well Design", "\\u2022 Thin-Walled Wells for Enhanced Thermal Consistency", "\\u2022 Protective Lid Included", "\\u2022 Excellent Optical Clarity", "\\u2022 Gamma Irradiated Sterility", "\\u2022 Non-Pyrogenic, DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Human DNA-Free", "\\u2022 Individually Packaged for Sterility and Convenience", "\\u2022 Suitable for Cell Culture and Cell-Based Assays"], "storageStability": "", "performanceData": "", "manuals": [], "manualUrls": [], "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "showInReagentSection": false, "isFeatured": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z'),
    (48, E'custom-1780978598488', E'15 mL Sterile Conical Centrifuge Tube, Rack Packed', E'BioArk Conical Sterile Centrifuge Tubes are manufactured from high-purity polypropylene (PP) resin and designed for reliable sample handling, storage, and centrifugation in molecular biology, clinical diagnostics, biotechnology, and biochemical research laboratories. The transparent construction provides excellent sample visibility, while the durable polypropylene material offers a safer and more practical alternative to glass tubes.\n\nProduced using advanced molding technology, these centrifuge tubes deliver consistent performance, excellent chemical resistance, and dependable durability for routine laboratory workflows. Clear black graduations and a large white writing area enable accurate volume measurement and convenient sample identification, improving laboratory efficiency and traceability.\n\nAvailable with either advanced screw caps or original plug-seal caps, BioArk centrifuge tubes provide secure sample containment during storage, transport, and centrifugation. Their high-quality construction and user-friendly design make them ideal for a wide range of research, clinical, and industrial laboratory applications.', E'/media/product_images/4c6d88c6-a42b-429a-bd47-85f0f2c4221a.webp', E'/reagents/15-ml-sterile-conical-centrifuge-tube-rack-packed', E'category-1780539818236', E'centrifuge Tubes', E'product', NULL, 1780978598488, E'2026-06-08T23:16:38.488000', E'BA801152', E'In Stock', E'$102', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Clear Volume Graduations – High-contrast printed graduations provide accurate volume measurement and easy sample monitoring.', E'• Large Writing Area – Expanded white marking panel allows convenient sample labeling, identification, and traceability.', E'• High Centrifugation Performance – Designed to withstand centrifugal forces up to 12,000 × g for reliable sample processing.', E'• Sterile and Contaminant-Free – Certified sterile, non-pyrogenic, DNase-free, and RNase-free for sensitive biological and molecular applications.', E'• Secure Sample Storage – Ideal for the storage and handling of larger-volume samples, reagents, buffers, and biological solutions.', E'• Suitable for Cell Culture Workflows – Provides safe and reliable handling of culture media, cell suspensions, and related reagents.', E'• Optimized for Molecular Biology and Microbiology – Supports sample preparation, centrifugation, and routine laboratory processing.', E'• Convenient Reagent Preparation – Well suited for preparing master mixes, buffers, dilution series, and other laboratory solutions.', E'• Durable Polypropylene Construction – Manufactured from high-purity polypropylene for excellent chemical resistance, transparency, and durability.']::text[], ARRAY[E'500 Pcs/Case']::text[], E'{}'::jsonb, E'', E'• Sample Centrifugation and Processing – Ideal for high-speed centrifugation procedures used to separate, concentrate, and collect biological and chemical samples.\n\n• Sample Storage and Preservation – Suitable for the short- and long-term storage of cells, biological specimens, reagents, buffers, and laboratory solutions.\n\n• Sample Transport and Handling – Provides secure containment for the safe transport of samples between laboratories, workstations, and storage facilities.\n\n• Cellular and Particle Separation – Supports the isolation and separation of cells, organelles, precipitates, proteins, nucleic acids, and other particulate materials.\n\n• Molecular Biology Workflows – Commonly used for DNA/RNA extraction, nucleic acid purification, PCR sample preparation, and other molecular biology applications.\n\n• Protein and Biochemistry Research – Suitable for protein precipitation, purification, sample preparation, and biochemical analysis procedures.\n\n• Cell Culture and Microbiology Applications – Ideal for handling cell suspensions, culture media, microbial samples, and related laboratory workflows.\n\n• Reagent Preparation and Mixing – Convenient for preparing, mixing, diluting, and storing laboratory reagents, buffers, and master mixes.\n\n• Research, Clinical, and Industrial Laboratories – Widely used in life science research, biotechnology, pharmaceutical development, diagnostics, and quality control environments.', E'', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[E'/media/product_images/4c6d88c6-a42b-429a-bd47-85f0f2c4221a.webp']::text[], E'https://store.bioarktech.com/cart', E'', FALSE, E'{"id": "custom-1780978598488", "name": "15 mL Sterile Conical Centrifuge Tube, Rack Packed", "description": "BioArk Conical Sterile Centrifuge Tubes are manufactured from high-purity polypropylene (PP) resin and designed for reliable sample handling, storage, and centrifugation in molecular biology, clinical diagnostics, biotechnology, and biochemical research laboratories. The transparent construction provides excellent sample visibility, while the durable polypropylene material offers a safer and more practical alternative to glass tubes.\\n\\nProduced using advanced molding technology, these centrifuge tubes deliver consistent performance, excellent chemical resistance, and dependable durability for routine laboratory workflows. Clear black graduations and a large white writing area enable accurate volume measurement and convenient sample identification, improving laboratory efficiency and traceability.\\n\\nAvailable with either advanced screw caps or original plug-seal caps, BioArk centrifuge tubes provide secure sample containment during storage, transport, and centrifugation. Their high-quality construction and user-friendly design make them ideal for a wide range of research, clinical, and industrial laboratory applications.", "imageUrl": "", "link": "/reagents/15-ml-sterile-conical-centrifuge-tube-rack-packed", "category": "category-1780539818236", "createdAt": 1780978598488, "groupName": "centrifuge Tubes"}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/4c6d88c6-a42b-429a-bd47-85f0f