d for both single-channel and multi-channel pipettes, these tips offer broad compatibility with most major pipette brands, including Eppendorf, Gilson, Thermo Fisher, Sartorius, Biohit, Oxford, DLAB, and other standard pipette systems.\\n\\nFeaturing an integrated aerosol barrier filter and low-retention surface technology, these tips help minimize the risk of cross-contamination, liquid backflow, and pipette contamination while maximizing sample recovery. The low-retention design reduces liquid adhesion, improving pipetting accuracy and consistency, particularly when working with valuable or low-volume samples.\\n\\nAs one of the most widely used pipette tip formats in research, clinical, and diagnostic laboratories, these universal filtered tips provide a cost-effective solution for routine liquid handling applications while maintaining high standards of quality and performance. Please note that Rainin pipettes require specially designed tips and are not compatible with standard universal pipette tips. Users of less common pipette brands are encouraged to verify compatibility prior to purchase.", "imageUrl": "", "link": "/reagents/1000-l-universal-pipette-tips-filtered-low-retention", "category": "category-1780539818236", "createdAt": 1780975995260, "groupName": "Pipette Tips"}'::jsonb, NULL, E'{"images": ["/media/product_images/bb285c11-92d7-4b8a-89d9-eb706f278b79.webp", "/media/product_images/ab51e8f1-f437-4128-9f53-851656e67228.webp", "/media/product_images/362b2dd2-11ab-4020-a0b1-b8028bcafd6c.webp", "/media/product_images/71b2ded9-f76d-4e59-a492-6f4c9278350f.webp", "/media/product_images/43a940cb-f20d-4c74-b19a-0bd2d0494fe1.webp"], "createdAt": 1780975995260, "catalogNumber": "800509-S", "availability": "In Stock", "listPrice": "$280", "options": ["10 Racks/Box; 5 Boxes/Case"], "optionPrices": {}, "keyFeatures": ["\\u2022 Low-Retention Surface for Enhanced Sample Recovery and Pipetting Accuracy", "\\u2022 Integrated Aerosol Barrier Filter Helps Prevent Cross-Contamination and Liquid Backflow", "\\u2022 Universal Compatibility with Most Major Single- and Multi-Channel Pipettes", "\\u2022 Manufactured in a Class 100,000 Cleanroom Environment", "\\u2022 Certified DNase-Free, RNase-Free, and Non-Pyrogenic", "\\u2022 Sterile and Ready-to-Use for Sensitive Laboratory Applications", "\\u2022 CE Marked and ISO 13485:2016 Certified", "\\u2022 Compliant with IVDD 98/79/EC Requirements", "\\u2022 Consistent Quality and Reliable Performance for Routine and Precision Liquid Handling", "\\u2022 Ideal for PCR, qPCR, Molecular Biology, Cell Culture, and Diagnostic Workflows"], "storageStability": "", "performanceData": "\\u2022 Accurate Liquid Transfer and Precision Pipetting\\n\\n\\u2022 Reagent, Buffer, and Sample Preparation\\n\\n\\u2022 PCR, qPCR, and Nucleic Acid Workflows\\n\\n\\u2022 Sample Dispensing into Microplates, PCR Plates, and Reaction Tubes\\n\\n\\u2022 Cell Culture and Microbiology Applications\\n\\n\\u2022 Electrophoresis Gel Loading\\n\\n\\u2022 ELISA and Diagnostic Assays\\n\\n\\u2022 Supernatant Transfer and Phase Separation Procedures\\n\\n\\u2022 High-Throughput Screening and Automated Liquid Handling\\n\\n\\u2022 Routine Research, Clinical, and Analytical Laboratory Operations", "manuals": [], "manualUrls": [], "storeLink": "https://store.bioarktech.com/cart", "showInReagentSection": false, "isFeatured": false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z', '2026-06-19T01:30:24.896Z'),
    (53, E'custom-1780977833573', E'25 mL Individually Wrapped Serological Pipette, Filtered', E'BioArk 25 mL Polystyrene Sterile Serological Pipettes are designed to provide accurate liquid measurement and transfer for a wide range of laboratory applications. Manufactured from high-clarity polystyrene, these disposable pipettes offer excellent visibility for precise volume reading and reliable performance in cell culture, molecular biology, microbiology, clinical diagnostics, and pharmaceutical research. Their precision-molded construction ensures consistent liquid handling and dependable results across routine laboratory workflows.\n\nEach pipette is individually wrapped and sterilized by gamma irradiation or E-beam processing to maintain sterility and support aseptic techniques. Certified RNase-free, DNase-free, and non-pyrogenic, these pipettes help minimize the risk of sample contamination, making them suitable for sensitive biological and diagnostic applications. Clear, bidirectional graduations and highly visible color-coded markings enable fast volume identification and accurate dispensing, improving workflow efficiency and user convenience.\n\nDesigned for seamless compatibility with most standard pipette controllers and pipette aids, Biofargo serological pipettes provide a convenient, cost-effective solution for daily laboratory liquid handling. Their combination of accuracy, sterility, and ease of use makes them an ideal choice for research, clinical, and industrial laboratory environments.', E'/media/product_images/fddb37f7-c05a-42aa-a6ab-3f4675b7b62a.webp', E'/reagents/25-ml-individually-wrapped-serological-pipette-filtered', E'category-1780539818236', E'Serological Pipettes', E'product', NULL, 1780977833573, E'2026-06-08T23:03:53.573000', E'BA804025', E'In Stock', E'$385', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, ARRAY[E'• Sterile and Ready for Immediate Use – Individually packaged and sterilized by E-beam or gamma irradiation to ensure aseptic handling and m